window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b055-4b21a231ad394e0a.json"]={sha256:"4b21a231ad394e0a0f219bd2b7201963be18f20672dd6e7bfbffbc6ca7641ef5",value:{"id":"b055","title":"橋梁預力鋼腱更換","titleEn":"Bridge prestressing-tendon replacement","category":"structures","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從預鑄節塊箱梁外置鋼腱的荷載路徑與冗餘度出發，說明灌漿離析與泌水如何讓鋼絞線在低氯離子下仍然腐蝕斷裂，再處理可更換細部、舊鋼腱去張的能量控制、新鋼腱張拉與伸長量核對、全橋普查、振動與聲射監測，並以美國 Mid-Bay、Ringling 堤道與 Wando River 等橋的鋼腱更換為實例。","summaryEn":"Starting from the load path and redundancy of external tendons in precast segmental box girders, explain how segregated, bleeding grout lets strands corrode and rupture even at low chloride, then cover replaceable detailing, energy control when detensioning the old tendon, force and elongation checks on the new one, network-wide surveys, and vibration and acoustic-emission monitoring, using the tendon replacements at the Mid-Bay, Ringling Causeway and Wando River bridges in the United States.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、吊裝或張拉作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, lifting or stressing permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"st-bridge-durability-monitoring","subcategoryTitle":"橋梁耐久、檢測與健康監測","subcategoryTitleEn":"Bridge durability, inspection and health monitoring","learningTrack":"structures","learningSubdiscipline":"st-bridge-durability-monitoring","learningTags":["structures","st-bridge-durability-monitoring","concrete"],"architectureFamily":"concrete","architectureNodes":[["外置鋼腱與錨定隔梁","External tendons and anchorage diaphragms"],["灌漿與防蝕包覆","Grout and corrosion protection"],["普查與振動檢測","Survey and vibration testing"],["去張與交通管制","Detensioning and traffic control"],["新鋼腱張拉驗收","New-tendon stressing acceptance"],["聲射監測與鋼腱履歷","Acoustic monitoring and tendon records"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,5],[2,5]],"diagram":{"type":"concrete","labels":["外置鋼腱與錨定隔梁","灌漿與防蝕包覆","普查與振動檢測","去張與交通管制","新鋼腱張拉驗收"],"labelsEn":["External tendons and anchorage diaphragms","Grout and corrosion protection","Survey and vibration testing","Detensioning and traffic control","New-tendon stressing acceptance"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"設計練習：某預鑄節塊箱梁每跨 6 條 19 股 15.2 mm 外置鋼腱，每條有效預力 2.97 MN；斷面 A = 6.0 m²、S_b = 3.5 m³、e = 1.2 m，服務彎矩 M = 30 MN·m，其中恆載 22 MN·m、活載 8 MN·m。(1) 六條鋼腱時底緣 σ_b = −17.82/6.0 − 17.82×1.2/3.5 + 30/3.5 ≈ −2.97 − 6.11 + 8.57 = −0.51 MPa。(2) 去張一條後 P = 14.85 MN，底緣零應力可承受的彎矩 M_0 = S_b·(P/A + P·e/S_b) = 3.5×(2.475 + 5.091) ≈ 26.5 MN·m，扣除恆載 22 MN·m 後活載只能用 4.5 MN·m，約為設計活載的 56%，需要封閉車道或禁行重車。(3) 新鋼腱以 P_j ≈ 3,857 kN 張拉，μ = 0.25、α = 0.20 rad、L = 120 m，平均力約 3,763 kN，伸長量 ΔL ≈ 0.87 m，250 mm 行程需 4 次。(4) 若改變一個輸入：更換期間加裝兩支臨時預力棒共 2.0 MN、偏心相同，底緣再增加壓應力 2.0/6.0 + 2.0×1.2/3.5 ≈ 1.02 MPa，M_0 升至約 30.0 MN·m，可恢復全部活載。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實際橋梁的設計。","textEn":"Design exercise: a precast segmental box girder has six external tendons of 19 × 15.2 mm strands per span, each with 2.97 MN effective prestress; the section has A = 6.0 m², S_b = 3.5 m³ and e = 1.2 m, and the service moment is M = 30 MN·m, of which 22 MN·m is dead load and 8 MN·m live load. (1) With six tendons the bottom fibre is σ_b = −17.82/6.0 − 17.82×1.2/3.5 + 30/3.5 ≈ −2.97 − 6.11 + 8.57 = −0.51 MPa. (2) With one tendon detensioned, P = 14.85 MN and the moment at zero bottom stress is M_0 = S_b·(P/A + P·e/S_b) = 3.5×(2.475 + 5.091) ≈ 26.5 MN·m; after 22 MN·m of dead load only 4.5 MN·m of live load remains, about 56% of the design live load, so lanes must be closed or heavy vehicles banned. (3) The new tendon is stressed to P_j ≈ 3,857 kN with μ = 0.25, α = 0.20 rad and L = 120 m; the average force is about 3,763 kN and the elongation ΔL ≈ 0.87 m, needing 4 strokes of 250 mm. (4) Changing one input: adding two temporary prestressing bars totalling 2.0 MN at the same eccentricity adds 2.0/6.0 + 2.0×1.2/3.5 ≈ 1.02 MPa of bottom compression, raising M_0 to about 30.0 MN·m so full live load can return. Values are teaching assumptions, not the design of any real bridge.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":13,"enrichmentVersion":13,"stages":[{"id":"b055-v13-s1","title":"工程背景、荷載與結構系統","titleEn":"Context, loads and structural system","description":"本階段聚焦「外置鋼腱的荷載路徑」與「移除一條鋼腱時的接縫應力」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Load path of external tendons\" and \"Joint stress with one tendon removed\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b055-v13-01","title":"外置鋼腱的荷載路徑：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Load path of external tendons: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「轉向塊與錨定隔梁」如何影響橋梁預力鋼腱更換的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Deviators and anchorage diaphragms” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge prestressing-tendon replacement”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"預鑄節塊箱梁的外置鋼腱位於箱室內、混凝土之外，只在錨定隔梁與轉向塊處與結構接觸：錨定處把預力以集中承壓傳入隔梁，轉向塊處鋼腱改變方向，產生向上的徑向力抵銷部分自重彎矩。因為鋼腱沿全長不與混凝土黏結，任何一處斷裂都會讓整條鋼腱在整個跨度內失去作用，而不像內置黏結鋼腱只在斷點附近局部失效；這正是外置鋼腱能夠更換、也必須事先規劃更換的原因。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「轉向塊與錨定隔梁」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"In a precast segmental box girder, external tendons run inside the box cell outside the concrete and touch the structure only at anchorage diaphragms and deviators: the anchorages push prestress into the diaphragm as concentrated bearing, and at each deviator the tendon changes direction, producing an upward radial force that offsets part of the self-weight moment. Because the tendon is not bonded to the concrete along its length, a break anywhere deactivates it over the whole span, unlike a bonded internal tendon that loses effect only near the break; that is exactly why external tendons can be replaced and why their replacement must be planned in advance. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Deviators and anchorage diaphragms” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：轉向力 F = 2P·sin(Δθ/2)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Deviator force F = 2P·sin(Δθ/2).","failure":"常見誤解：「外置鋼腱斷一條只影響斷點附近，其餘跨段照常有預力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"When one external tendon breaks, only the region near the break loses prestress.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「轉向塊與錨定隔梁」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Deviators and anchorage diaphragms”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-01-k1","title":"外置鋼腱的荷載路徑","titleEn":"Load path of external tendons","text":"預鑄節塊箱梁的外置鋼腱位於箱室內、混凝土之外，只在錨定隔梁與轉向塊處與結構接觸：錨定處把預力以集中承壓傳入隔梁，轉向塊處鋼腱改變方向，產生向上的徑向力抵銷部分自重彎矩。因為鋼腱沿全長不與混凝土黏結，任何一處斷裂都會讓整條鋼腱在整個跨度內失去作用，而不像內置黏結鋼腱只在斷點附近局部失效；這正是外置鋼腱能夠更換、也必須事先規劃更換的原因。","textEn":"In a precast segmental box girder, external tendons run inside the box cell outside the concrete and touch the structure only at anchorage diaphragms and deviators: the anchorages push prestress into the diaphragm as concentrated bearing, and at each deviator the tendon changes direction, producing an upward radial force that offsets part of the self-weight moment. Because the tendon is not bonded to the concrete along its length, a break anywhere deactivates it over the whole span, unlike a bonded internal tendon that loses effect only near the break; that is exactly why external tendons can be replaced and why their replacement must be planned in advance.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：外置鋼腱斷一條只影響斷點附近，其餘跨段照常有預力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: When one external tendon breaks, only the region near the break loses prestress. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「外置鋼腱的荷載路徑」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Load path of external tendons\" is correct?","options":["外置鋼腱斷一條只影響斷點附近，其餘跨段照常有預力。","預鑄節塊箱梁的外置鋼腱位於箱室內、混凝土之外，只在錨定隔梁與轉向塊處與結構接觸：錨定處把預力以集中承壓傳入隔梁，轉向塊處鋼腱改變方向，產生向上的徑向力抵銷部分自重彎矩。","只要其餘鋼腱沒斷，更換期間的橋就和平常一樣安全。"],"optionsEn":["When one external tendon breaks, only the region near the break loses prestress.","In a precast segmental box girder, external tendons run inside the box cell outside the concrete and touch the structure only at anchorage diaphragms and deviators: the anchorages push prestress into the diaphragm as concentrated bearing, and at each deviator the tendon changes direction, producing an upward radial force that offsets part of the self-weight moment.","As long as the other tendons are intact, the bridge is as safe as usual during a replacement."],"answer":1,"explanation":"預鑄節塊箱梁的外置鋼腱位於箱室內、混凝土之外，只在錨定隔梁與轉向塊處與結構接觸：錨定處把預力以集中承壓傳入隔梁，轉向塊處鋼腱改變方向，產生向上的徑向力抵銷部分自重彎矩。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"In a precast segmental box girder, external tendons run inside the box cell outside the concrete and touch the structure only at anchorage diaphragms and deviators: the anchorages push prestress into the diaphragm as concentrated bearing, and at each deviator the tendon changes direction, producing an upward radial force that offsets part of the self-weight moment. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b055-v13-02","title":"外置鋼腱的荷載路徑：定量估算","titleEn":"Load path of external tendons: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「轉向塊與錨定隔梁」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Deviators and anchorage diaphragms” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：轉向力 F = 2P·sin(Δθ/2)。取有效預力 P = 2,970 kN（19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線、0.60 f_pu）、轉向角 Δθ = 6°，F = 2×2,970×sin3° ≈ 311 kN；一跨兩處轉向塊、六條鋼腱，總向上力約 2×6×311 ≈ 3,730 kN。失去一條鋼腱，這部分向上力就少約 622 kN。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Deviator force F = 2P·sin(Δθ/2). With effective prestress P = 2,970 kN (19 strands of 15.2 mm at 0.60 f_pu) and a deviation of Δθ = 6°, F = 2×2,970×sin3° ≈ 311 kN; two deviators and six tendons per span give about 2×6×311 ≈ 3,730 kN of upward force. Losing one tendon removes about 622 kN of it. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以竣工圖與預力施工紀錄核對每條鋼腱的路線、轉向角與張拉力，並在結構模型中逐跨計算轉向力與錨定區承壓應力；現場檢查轉向塊與隔梁是否有放射狀裂縫、埋設鋼管滑出或混凝土剝落，拍照編號作為更換前的基準狀態。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check each tendon's profile, deviation angles and stressing force against as-built drawings and stressing records, compute deviator forces and anchorage-zone bearing stresses span by span in the structural model, and inspect deviators and diaphragms for radial cracks, embedded pipes sliding out or spalling, photographing and numbering them as the baseline condition before any replacement.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"轉向力 F = 2P·sin(Δθ/2)。取有效預力 P = 2,970 kN（19 股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線、0.60 f_pu）、轉向角 Δθ = 6°，F = 2×2,970×sin3° ≈ 311 kN；一跨兩處轉向塊、六條鋼腱，總向上力約 2×6×311 ≈ 3,730 kN。失去一條鋼腱，這部分向上力就少約 622 kN。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Deviator force F = 2P·sin(Δθ/2). With effective prestress P = 2,970 kN (19 strands of 15.2 mm at 0.60 f_pu) and a deviation of Δθ = 6°, F = 2×2,970×sin3° ≈ 311 kN; two deviators and six tendons per span give about 2×6×311 ≈ 3,730 kN of upward force. Losing one tendon removes about 622 kN of it. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「外置鋼腱的荷載路徑」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Load path of external tendons\", which statement holds?","options":["外置鋼腱因為看得到，天生就可以更換，不需要特別的細部。","千斤頂油壓達到目標值，就證明整條鋼腱的力量都正確。","轉向力 F = 2P·sin(Δθ/2)。"],"optionsEn":["Because external tendons are visible, they are inherently replaceable without special detailing.","Reaching the target jack pressure proves the force is correct along the whole tendon.","Deviator force F = 2P·sin(Δθ/2)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"轉向力 F = 2P·sin(Δθ/2)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Deviator force F = 2P·sin(Δθ/2). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b055-v13-03","title":"外置鋼腱的荷載路徑：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Load path of external tendons: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「轉向塊與錨定隔梁」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Deviators and anchorage diaphragms” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以竣工圖與預力施工紀錄核對每條鋼腱的路線、轉向角與張拉力，並在結構模型中逐跨計算轉向力與錨定區承壓應力；現場檢查轉向塊與隔梁是否有放射狀裂縫、埋設鋼管滑出或混凝土剝落，拍照編號作為更換前的基準狀態。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check each tendon's profile, deviation angles and stressing force against as-built drawings and stressing records, compute deviator forces and anchorage-zone bearing stresses span by span in the structural model, and inspect deviators and diaphragms for radial cracks, embedded pipes sliding out or spalling, photographing and numbering them as the baseline condition before any replacement. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：設計時就要在說明中寫明每一條外置鋼腱都可在交通管制下單獨更換，並在計算書逐跨列出移除任一條鋼腱時的應力檢核與所需交通限制，讓日後的管理單位不必重新推導。","observationEn":"Site practice: State in the design that every external tendon can be replaced individually under traffic management, and list in the calculations, span by span, the stress check with any one tendon removed and the traffic restriction it requires, so the future owner does not have to re-derive it.","failure":"注意干擾：2000 年佛州 Mid-Bay 大橋例行檢查發現一條鋼腱因錨定區嚴重腐蝕而由伸縮縫隔梁拉脫、整條鬆弛，灌漿鋼管也在斷裂時被拉出隔梁；外置鋼腱斷裂時釋放的能量還可能撞擊並損壞轉向塊與箱室內設備。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: In 2000 a routine inspection of Florida's Mid-Bay Bridge found a tendon that had separated from an expansion-joint diaphragm after severe anchorage-zone corrosion and gone completely slack, with its grouted steel pipe pulled out of the diaphragm during the rupture; the energy released by a breaking external tendon can also strike and damage deviators and equipment inside the box. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以竣工圖與預力施工紀錄核對每條鋼腱的路線、轉向角與張拉力，並在結構模型中逐跨計算轉向力與錨定區承壓應力；現場檢查轉向塊與隔梁是否有放射狀裂縫、埋設鋼管滑出或混凝土剝落，拍照編號作為更換前的基準狀態。","textEn":"Check each tendon's profile, deviation angles and stressing force against as-built drawings and stressing records, compute deviator forces and anchorage-zone bearing stresses span by span in the structural model, and inspect deviators and diaphragms for radial cracks, embedded pipes sliding out or spalling, photographing and numbering them as the baseline condition before any replacement.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"設計時就要在說明中寫明每一條外置鋼腱都可在交通管制下單獨更換，並在計算書逐跨列出移除任一條鋼腱時的應力檢核與所需交通限制，讓日後的管理單位不必重新推導。","textEn":"State in the design that every external tendon can be replaced individually under traffic management, and list in the calculations, span by span, the stress check with any one tendon removed and the traffic restriction it requires, so the future owner does not have to re-derive it.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「外置鋼腱的荷載路徑」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Load path of external tendons\"?","options":["以竣工圖與預力施工紀錄核對每條鋼腱的路線、轉向角與張拉力，並在結構模型中逐跨計算轉向力與錨定區承壓應力。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","鋼腱振動頻率只要有變化，就一定是斷了鋼絲。"],"optionsEn":["Check each tendon's profile, deviation angles and stressing force against as-built drawings and stressing records, compute deviator forces and anchorage-zone bearing stresses span by span in the structural model, and inspect deviators and diaphragms for radial cracks, embedded pipes sliding out or spalling, photographing and numbering them as the baseline condition before any replacement.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Any change in a tendon's vibration frequency must mean broken wires."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以竣工圖與預力施工紀錄核對每條鋼腱的路線、轉向角與張拉力，並在結構模型中逐跨計算轉向力與錨定區承壓應力；現場檢查轉向塊與隔梁是否有放射狀裂縫、埋設鋼管滑出或混凝土剝落，拍照編號作為更換前的基準狀態。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check each tendon's profile, deviation angles and stressing force against as-built drawings and stressing records, compute deviator forces and anchorage-zone bearing stresses span by span in the structural model, and inspect deviators and diaphragms for radial cracks, embedded pipes sliding out or spalling, photographing and numbering them as the baseline condition before any replacement. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b055-v13-04","title":"外置鋼腱的荷載路徑：失效診斷","titleEn":"Load path of external tendons: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「轉向塊與錨定隔梁」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Deviators and anchorage diaphragms” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"2000 年佛州 Mid-Bay 大橋例行檢查發現一條鋼腱因錨定區嚴重腐蝕而由伸縮縫隔梁拉脫、整條鬆弛，灌漿鋼管也在斷裂時被拉出隔梁；外置鋼腱斷裂時釋放的能量還可能撞擊並損壞轉向塊與箱室內設備。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"In 2000 a routine inspection of Florida's Mid-Bay Bridge found a tendon that had separated from an expansion-joint diaphragm after severe anchorage-zone corrosion and gone completely slack, with its grouted steel pipe pulled out of the diaphragm during the rupture; the energy released by a breaking external tendon can also strike and damage deviators and equipment inside the box. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：因為鋼腱沿全長不與混凝土黏結，任何一處斷裂都會讓整條鋼腱在整個跨度內失去作用，而不像內置黏結鋼腱只在斷點附近局部失效；這正是外置鋼腱能夠更換、也必須事先規劃更換的原因。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Because the tendon is not bonded to the concrete along its length, a break anywhere deactivates it over the whole span, unlike a bonded internal tendon that loses effect only near the break; that is exactly why external tendons can be replaced and why their replacement must be planned in advance.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「外置鋼腱斷一條只影響斷點附近，其餘跨段照常有預力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"When one external tendon breaks, only the region near the break loses prestress.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"2000 年佛州 Mid-Bay 大橋例行檢查發現一條鋼腱因錨定區嚴重腐蝕而由伸縮縫隔梁拉脫、整條鬆弛，灌漿鋼管也在斷裂時被拉出隔梁；外置鋼腱斷裂時釋放的能量還可能撞擊並損壞轉向塊與箱室內設備。","textEn":"In 2000 a routine inspection of Florida's Mid-Bay Bridge found a tendon that had separated from an expansion-joint diaphragm after severe anchorage-zone corrosion and gone completely slack, with its grouted steel pipe pulled out of the diaphragm during the rupture; the energy released by a breaking external tendon can also strike and damage deviators and equipment inside the box.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「外置鋼腱的荷載路徑」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Load path of external tendons\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","2000 年佛州 Mid-Bay 大橋例行檢查發現一條鋼腱因錨定區嚴重腐蝕而由伸縮縫隔梁拉脫、整條鬆弛，灌漿鋼管也在斷裂時被拉出隔梁。","只要其餘鋼腱沒斷，更換期間的橋就和平常一樣安全。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","In 2000 a routine inspection of Florida's Mid-Bay Bridge found a tendon that had separated from an expansion-joint diaphragm after severe anchorage-zone corrosion and gone completely slack, with its grouted steel pipe pulled out of the diaphragm during the rupture.","As long as the other tendons are intact, the bridge is as safe as usual during a replacement."],"answer":1,"explanation":"2000 年佛州 Mid-Bay 大橋例行檢查發現一條鋼腱因錨定區嚴重腐蝕而由伸縮縫隔梁拉脫、整條鬆弛，灌漿鋼管也在斷裂時被拉出隔梁；外置鋼腱斷裂時釋放的能量還可能撞擊並損壞轉向塊與箱室內設備。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"In 2000 a routine inspection of Florida's Mid-Bay Bridge found a tendon that had separated from an expansion-joint diaphragm after severe anchorage-zone corrosion and gone completely slack, with its grouted steel pipe pulled out of the diaphragm during the rupture; the energy released by a breaking external tendon can also strike and damage deviators and equipment inside the box. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b055-v13-05","title":"移除一條鋼腱時的接縫應力：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Joint stress with one tendon removed: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-04"],"objective":"說明「節塊接縫底緣應力」如何影響橋梁預力鋼腱更換的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Bottom-fibre stress at segment joints” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge prestressing-tendon replacement”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"預鑄節塊之間的接縫通常沒有鋼筋穿越，接縫能否保持閉合完全依賴預力在底緣留下的壓應力。正常使用時，預力的軸壓與偏心彎矩抵銷恆載與活載彎矩，使底緣仍保有少量壓應力儲備；更換鋼腱時必須先把舊鋼腱去張，等於在施工期間主動讓該跨少一條鋼腱數週。因此更換工程的第一個問題不是怎麼切，而是少一條鋼腱時接縫會不會出現拉應力而張開，以及需要多少交通管制或臨時預力才能避免。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「節塊接縫底緣應力」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Joints between precast segments usually have no reinforcement crossing them, so whether a joint stays closed depends entirely on the compression that prestress leaves in the bottom fibre. In service, the axial prestress and its eccentric moment offset dead- and live-load moments, leaving a small compressive reserve; replacing a tendon means deliberately detensioning the old one, so the span works one tendon short for weeks. The first question of a replacement is therefore not how to cut, but whether the joints decompress and open with one tendon missing, and how much traffic restriction or temporary prestress prevents it. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Bottom-fibre stress at segment joints” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：σ_b = −P/A − P·e/S_b + M/S_b。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: σ_b = −P/A − P·e/S_b + M/S_b.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要其餘鋼腱沒斷，更換期間的橋就和平常一樣安全。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"As long as the other tendons are intact, the bridge is as safe as usual during a replacement.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「節塊接縫底緣應力」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Bottom-fibre stress at segment joints”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-05-k1","title":"移除一條鋼腱時的接縫應力","titleEn":"Joint stress with one tendon removed","text":"預鑄節塊之間的接縫通常沒有鋼筋穿越，接縫能否保持閉合完全依賴預力在底緣留下的壓應力。正常使用時，預力的軸壓與偏心彎矩抵銷恆載與活載彎矩，使底緣仍保有少量壓應力儲備；更換鋼腱時必須先把舊鋼腱去張，等於在施工期間主動讓該跨少一條鋼腱數週。","textEn":"Joints between precast segments usually have no reinforcement crossing them, so whether a joint stays closed depends entirely on the compression that prestress leaves in the bottom fibre. In service, the axial prestress and its eccentric moment offset dead- and live-load moments, leaving a small compressive reserve; replacing a tendon means deliberately detensioning the old one, so the span works one tendon short for weeks.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要其餘鋼腱沒斷，更換期間的橋就和平常一樣安全。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: As long as the other tendons are intact, the bridge is as safe as usual during a replacement. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「移除一條鋼腱時的接縫應力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Joint stress with one tendon removed\" is correct?","options":["只要其餘鋼腱沒斷，更換期間的橋就和平常一樣安全。","只要灌漿的氯離子含量很低，鋼腱就不會腐蝕。","預鑄節塊之間的接縫通常沒有鋼筋穿越，接縫能否保持閉合完全依賴預力在底緣留下的壓應力。"],"optionsEn":["As long as the other tendons are intact, the bridge is as safe as usual during a replacement.","If grout chloride content is very low, the tendon cannot corrode.","Joints between precast segments usually have no reinforcement crossing them, so whether a joint stays closed depends entirely on the compression that prestress leaves in the bottom fibre."],"answer":2,"explanation":"預鑄節塊之間的接縫通常沒有鋼筋穿越，接縫能否保持閉合完全依賴預力在底緣留下的壓應力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Joints between precast segments usually have no reinforcement crossing them, so whether a joint stays closed depends entirely on the compression that prestress leaves in the bottom fibre. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b055-v13-06","title":"移除一條鋼腱時的接縫應力：定量估算","titleEn":"Joint stress with one tendon removed: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「節塊接縫底緣應力」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Bottom-fibre stress at segment joints” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：σ_b = −P/A − P·e/S_b + M/S_b。設 A = 6.0 m²、S_b = 3.5 m³、e = 1.2 m、M = 30 MN·m。六條鋼腱 P = 17.82 MN：σ_b = −2.97 − 6.11 + 8.57 ≈ −0.51 MPa（受壓）；去掉一條後 P = 14.85 MN：σ_b = −2.48 − 5.09 + 8.57 ≈ +1.00 MPa（受拉，接縫可能張開）。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: σ_b = −P/A − P·e/S_b + M/S_b. Take A = 6.0 m², S_b = 3.5 m³, e = 1.2 m and M = 30 MN·m. With six tendons, P = 17.82 MN gives σ_b = −2.97 − 6.11 + 8.57 ≈ −0.51 MPa (compression); with one removed, P = 14.85 MN gives σ_b = −2.48 − 5.09 + 8.57 ≈ +1.00 MPa (tension, the joint may open). Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以施工階段模型逐步模擬「舊鋼腱去張、空缺期、新鋼腱張拉」三個狀態，檢查每個接縫在設計活載與溫度梯度下的應力；現場在接縫兩側安裝裂縫計或位移計，去張期間連續記錄接縫開口，超過預定警戒值（例如 0.1 mm）即停工檢討。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Model the three construction states, old tendon detensioned, gap period and new tendon stressed, and check every joint under design live load and thermal gradient; on site, fit crack gauges or displacement transducers across joints and log opening continuously during detensioning, stopping work for review if a preset alert value such as 0.1 mm is exceeded.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"σ_b = −P/A − P·e/S_b + M/S_b。設 A = 6.0 m²、S_b = 3.5 m³、e = 1.2 m、M = 30 MN·m。六條鋼腱 P = 17.82 MN：σ_b = −2.97 − 6.11 + 8.57 ≈ −0.51 MPa（受壓）；去掉一條後 P = 14.85 MN：σ_b = −2.48 − 5.09 + 8.57 ≈ +1.00 MPa（受拉，接縫可能張開）。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"σ_b = −P/A − P·e/S_b + M/S_b. Take A = 6.0 m², S_b = 3.5 m³, e = 1.2 m and M = 30 MN·m. With six tendons, P = 17.82 MN gives σ_b = −2.97 − 6.11 + 8.57 ≈ −0.51 MPa (compression); with one removed, P = 14.85 MN gives σ_b = −2.48 − 5.09 + 8.57 ≈ +1.00 MPa (tension, the joint may open). Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「移除一條鋼腱時的接縫應力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Joint stress with one tendon removed\", which statement holds?","options":["σ_b = −P/A − P·e/S_b + M/S_b。","鋼腱已經斷了一部分，剩下的鋼絞線可以直接在錨頭燒斷。","只要套管外觀沒有裂縫，裡面的鋼腱就一定完好。"],"optionsEn":["σ_b = −P/A − P·e/S_b + M/S_b.","Once part of a tendon has broken, the remaining strands can simply be torched off at the anchorage.","If the duct shows no cracks outside, the tendon inside must be sound."],"answer":0,"explanation":"σ_b = −P/A − P·e/S_b + M/S_b。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"σ_b = −P/A − P·e/S_b + M/S_b. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b055-v13-07","title":"移除一條鋼腱時的接縫應力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Joint stress with one tendon removed: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「節塊接縫底緣應力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Bottom-fibre stress at segment joints” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以施工階段模型逐步模擬「舊鋼腱去張、空缺期、新鋼腱張拉」三個狀態，檢查每個接縫在設計活載與溫度梯度下的應力；現場在接縫兩側安裝裂縫計或位移計，去張期間連續記錄接縫開口，超過預定警戒值（例如 0.1 mm）即停工檢討。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Model the three construction states, old tendon detensioned, gap period and new tendon stressed, and check every joint under design live load and thermal gradient; on site, fit crack gauges or displacement transducers across joints and log opening continuously during detensioning, stopping work for review if a preset alert value such as 0.1 mm is exceeded. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：更換計畫應附上每一跨、每一條鋼腱移除時所需的交通限制表（車道封閉、重車禁行或限速），以及必要時的臨時預力棒配置，由原設計者或獨立審查工程師簽認後才能動工。","observationEn":"Site practice: The replacement plan should attach, for every span and every tendon, a table of required traffic restrictions (lane closure, heavy-vehicle ban or speed limit) and any temporary prestressing bars, signed by the original designer or an independent checking engineer before work starts.","failure":"注意干擾：若沒有先算出少一條鋼腱的狀態就開放全部交通，接縫可能在重車通過時反覆張開又閉合，環氧樹脂接縫劣化、水氣進入，反而加速鄰近鋼腱的腐蝕，使一次更換演變成連鎖問題。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Skipping the one-tendon-short check and keeping full traffic lets joints open and close under every heavy truck, degrading the epoxy joints and admitting moisture, which accelerates corrosion of the neighbouring tendons and turns one replacement into a chain of problems. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以施工階段模型逐步模擬「舊鋼腱去張、空缺期、新鋼腱張拉」三個狀態，檢查每個接縫在設計活載與溫度梯度下的應力；現場在接縫兩側安裝裂縫計或位移計，去張期間連續記錄接縫開口，超過預定警戒值（例如 0.1 mm）即停工檢討。","textEn":"Model the three construction states, old tendon detensioned, gap period and new tendon stressed, and check every joint under design live load and thermal gradient; on site, fit crack gauges or displacement transducers across joints and log opening continuously during detensioning, stopping work for review if a preset alert value such as 0.1 mm is exceeded.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"更換計畫應附上每一跨、每一條鋼腱移除時所需的交通限制表（車道封閉、重車禁行或限速），以及必要時的臨時預力棒配置，由原設計者或獨立審查工程師簽認後才能動工。","textEn":"The replacement plan should attach, for every span and every tendon, a table of required traffic restrictions (lane closure, heavy-vehicle ban or speed limit) and any temporary prestressing bars, signed by the original designer or an independent checking engineer before work starts.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「移除一條鋼腱時的接縫應力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Joint stress with one tendon removed\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","以施工階段模型逐步模擬「舊鋼腱去張、空缺期、新鋼腱張拉」三個狀態，檢查每個接縫在設計活載與溫度梯度下的應力。","真空灌注可以讓已腐蝕的鋼腱恢復原來的強度。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Model the three construction states, old tendon detensioned, gap period and new tendon stressed, and check every joint under design live load and thermal gradient.","Vacuum injection restores a corroded tendon to its original strength."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以施工階段模型逐步模擬「舊鋼腱去張、空缺期、新鋼腱張拉」三個狀態，檢查每個接縫在設計活載與溫度梯度下的應力；現場在接縫兩側安裝裂縫計或位移計，去張期間連續記錄接縫開口，超過預定警戒值（例如 0.1 mm）即停工檢討。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Model the three construction states, old tendon detensioned, gap period and new tendon stressed, and check every joint under design live load and thermal gradient; on site, fit crack gauges or displacement transducers across joints and log opening continuously during detensioning, stopping work for review if a preset alert value such as 0.1 mm is exceeded. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b055-v13-08","title":"移除一條鋼腱時的接縫應力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Joint stress with one tendon removed: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「節塊接縫底緣應力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Bottom-fibre stress at segment joints” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若沒有先算出少一條鋼腱的狀態就開放全部交通，接縫可能在重車通過時反覆張開又閉合，環氧樹脂接縫劣化、水氣進入，反而加速鄰近鋼腱的腐蝕，使一次更換演變成連鎖問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Skipping the one-tendon-short check and keeping full traffic lets joints open and close under every heavy truck, degrading the epoxy joints and admitting moisture, which accelerates corrosion of the neighbouring tendons and turns one replacement into a chain of problems. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：因此更換工程的第一個問題不是怎麼切，而是少一條鋼腱時接縫會不會出現拉應力而張開，以及需要多少交通管制或臨時預力才能避免。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The first question of a replacement is therefore not how to cut, but whether the joints decompress and open with one tendon missing, and how much traffic restriction or temporary prestress prevents it.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要其餘鋼腱沒斷，更換期間的橋就和平常一樣安全。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"As long as the other tendons are intact, the bridge is as safe as usual during a replacement.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若沒有先算出少一條鋼腱的狀態就開放全部交通，接縫可能在重車通過時反覆張開又閉合，環氧樹脂接縫劣化、水氣進入，反而加速鄰近鋼腱的腐蝕，使一次更換演變成連鎖問題。","textEn":"Skipping the one-tendon-short check and keeping full traffic lets joints open and close under every heavy truck, degrading the epoxy joints and admitting moisture, which accelerates corrosion of the neighbouring tendons and turns one replacement into a chain of problems.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「移除一條鋼腱時的接縫應力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Joint stress with one tendon removed\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","只要灌漿的氯離子含量很低，鋼腱就不會腐蝕。","若沒有先算出少一條鋼腱的狀態就開放全部交通，接縫可能在重車通過時反覆張開又閉合，環氧樹脂接縫劣化、水氣進入，反而加速鄰近鋼腱的腐蝕，使一次更換演變成連鎖問題。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","If grout chloride content is very low, the tendon cannot corrode.","Skipping the one-tendon-short check and keeping full traffic lets joints open and close under every heavy truck, degrading the epoxy joints and admitting moisture, which accelerates corrosion of the neighbouring tendons and turns one replacement into a chain of problems."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若沒有先算出少一條鋼腱的狀態就開放全部交通，接縫可能在重車通過時反覆張開又閉合，環氧樹脂接縫劣化、水氣進入，反而加速鄰近鋼腱的腐蝕，使一次更換演變成連鎖問題。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Skipping the one-tendon-short check and keeping full traffic lets joints open and close under every heavy truck, degrading the epoxy joints and admitting moisture, which accelerates corrosion of the neighbouring tendons and turns one replacement into a chain of problems. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b055-v13-s2","title":"材料、構件與接合細部","titleEn":"Materials, members and connection details","description":"本階段聚焦「鋼絞線腐蝕與殘餘強度」與「可更換鋼腱的細部設計」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Strand corrosion and residual strength\" and \"Detailing for replaceable tendons\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b055-v13-09","title":"鋼絞線腐蝕與殘餘強度：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Strand corrosion and residual strength: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-08"],"objective":"說明「灌漿空隙與泌水」如何影響橋梁預力鋼腱更換的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Grout voids and bleed water” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge prestressing-tendon replacement”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"灌漿鋼腱的防蝕依靠水泥漿的高鹼性與完整包覆，但灌漿若離析、泌水，會在鋼腱高點、錨頭與轉向處留下空隙與軟弱漿體。FHWA 對 Mid-Bay 的彙整指出，即使灌漿氯離子含量很低，碳化、離析灌漿與多餘泌水仍會在氧氣與水氣存在下造成快速腐蝕；Wando River 橋與 Ringling 堤道橋也都找到離析、粉狀或濕軟的灌漿帶。腐蝕常集中在少數鋼絞線，鋼絲先在局部斷裂，灌漿又把附近未斷的鋼絲綁在一起，使殘存鋼絲在斷點附近承擔更高應力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「灌漿空隙與泌水」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Grouted tendons rely on the high alkalinity and full encapsulation of cement grout, but segregated or bleeding grout leaves voids and soft paste at high points, anchorages and deviators. FHWA's review of Mid-Bay concluded that carbonation, segregated grout and excess bleed water caused rapid corrosion in the presence of oxygen and moisture even though grout chloride was very low; investigations at the Wando River and Ringling Causeway bridges also found segregated, chalky or soft wet grout bands. Corrosion usually concentrates in a few strands, wires break locally, and the grout ties nearby intact wires together so that the survivors carry higher stress near the break. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Grout voids and bleed water” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：19 股鋼腱 A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm²、f_pu = 1,860 MPa，極限力 F_pu ≈ 4,950 kN，有效預力 0.60F_pu ≈ 2,970 kN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 19-strand tendon has A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm² and f_pu = 1,860 MPa, so F_pu ≈ 4,950 kN and the effective prestress 0.60F_pu ≈ 2,970 kN.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要灌漿的氯離子含量很低，鋼腱就不會腐蝕。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If grout chloride content is very low, the tendon cannot corrode.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「灌漿空隙與泌水」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Grout voids and bleed water”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-09-k1","title":"鋼絞線腐蝕與殘餘強度","titleEn":"Strand corrosion and residual strength","text":"灌漿鋼腱的防蝕依靠水泥漿的高鹼性與完整包覆，但灌漿若離析、泌水，會在鋼腱高點、錨頭與轉向處留下空隙與軟弱漿體。FHWA 對 Mid-Bay 的彙整指出，即使灌漿氯離子含量很低，碳化、離析灌漿與多餘泌水仍會在氧氣與水氣存在下造成快速腐蝕；Wando River 橋與 Ringling 堤道橋也都找到離析、粉狀或濕軟的灌漿帶。","textEn":"Grouted tendons rely on the high alkalinity and full encapsulation of cement grout, but segregated or bleeding grout leaves voids and soft paste at high points, anchorages and deviators. FHWA's review of Mid-Bay concluded that carbonation, segregated grout and excess bleed water caused rapid corrosion in the presence of oxygen and moisture even though grout chloride was very low; investigations at the Wando River and Ringling Causeway bridges also found segregated, chalky or soft wet grout bands.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要灌漿的氯離子含量很低，鋼腱就不會腐蝕。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If grout chloride content is very low, the tendon cannot corrode. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「鋼絞線腐蝕與殘餘強度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Strand corrosion and residual strength\" is correct?","options":["灌漿鋼腱的防蝕依靠水泥漿的高鹼性與完整包覆，但灌漿若離析、泌水，會在鋼腱高點、錨頭與轉向處留下空隙與軟弱漿體。","只要灌漿的氯離子含量很低，鋼腱就不會腐蝕。","外置鋼腱因為看得到，天生就可以更換，不需要特別的細部。"],"optionsEn":["Grouted tendons rely on the high alkalinity and full encapsulation of cement grout, but segregated or bleeding grout leaves voids and soft paste at high points, anchorages and deviators.","If grout chloride content is very low, the tendon cannot corrode.","Because external tendons are visible, they are inherently replaceable without special detailing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"灌漿鋼腱的防蝕依靠水泥漿的高鹼性與完整包覆，但灌漿若離析、泌水，會在鋼腱高點、錨頭與轉向處留下空隙與軟弱漿體。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Grouted tendons rely on the high alkalinity and full encapsulation of cement grout, but segregated or bleeding grout leaves voids and soft paste at high points, anchorages and deviators. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b055-v13-10","title":"鋼絞線腐蝕與殘餘強度：定量估算","titleEn":"Strand corrosion and residual strength: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「灌漿空隙與泌水」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Grout voids and bleed water” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：19 股鋼腱 A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm²、f_pu = 1,860 MPa，極限力 F_pu ≈ 4,950 kN，有效預力 0.60F_pu ≈ 2,970 kN。若灌漿在斷點附近把力量局部鎖住，殘存面積比降到 0.60/0.90 ≈ 0.67 時殘存鋼絲達降伏（約斷 6.3 股），降到 0.60 時達極限（約斷 7.6 股）。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 19-strand tendon has A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm² and f_pu = 1,860 MPa, so F_pu ≈ 4,950 kN and the effective prestress 0.60F_pu ≈ 2,970 kN. If the grout locks the force locally near a break, the survivors yield when the remaining area ratio falls to 0.60/0.90 ≈ 0.67 (about 6.3 strands lost) and reach ultimate at 0.60 (about 7.6 strands lost). Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在鋼腱高點、錨頭後方與轉向塊兩側鑽小孔，以內視鏡觀察空隙與鋼絲表面，取灌漿樣本做氯離子、硫酸根、含水率與碳化試驗；鋼絲樣本則量測截面損失與腐蝕型態，每一筆結果都標註到鋼腱編號與位置。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Drill small holes at tendon high points, behind anchorages and on both sides of deviators, inspect voids and wire surfaces with a borescope, and test grout samples for chloride, sulfate, moisture content and carbonation; measure section loss and corrosion morphology on wire samples, and tag every result to the tendon number and location.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"19 股鋼腱 A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm²、f_pu = 1,860 MPa，極限力 F_pu ≈ 4,950 kN，有效預力 0.60F_pu ≈ 2,970 kN。若灌漿在斷點附近把力量局部鎖住，殘存面積比降到 0.60/0.90 ≈ 0.67 時殘存鋼絲達降伏（約斷 6.3 股），降到 0.60 時達極限（約斷 7.6 股）。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"A 19-strand tendon has A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm² and f_pu = 1,860 MPa, so F_pu ≈ 4,950 kN and the effective prestress 0.60F_pu ≈ 2,970 kN. If the grout locks the force locally near a break, the survivors yield when the remaining area ratio falls to 0.60/0.90 ≈ 0.67 (about 6.3 strands lost) and reach ultimate at 0.60 (about 7.6 strands lost). Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「鋼絞線腐蝕與殘餘強度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Strand corrosion and residual strength\", which statement holds?","options":["千斤頂油壓達到目標值，就證明整條鋼腱的力量都正確。","19 股鋼腱 A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm²、f_pu = 1,860 MPa，極限力 F_pu ≈ 4,950 kN，有效預力 0.60F_pu ≈ 2,970 kN。","鋼腱振動頻率只要有變化，就一定是斷了鋼絲。"],"optionsEn":["Reaching the target jack pressure proves the force is correct along the whole tendon.","A 19-strand tendon has A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm² and f_pu = 1,860 MPa, so F_pu ≈ 4,950 kN and the effective prestress 0.60F_pu ≈ 2,970 kN.","Any change in a tendon's vibration frequency must mean broken wires."],"answer":1,"explanation":"19 股鋼腱 A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm²、f_pu = 1,860 MPa，極限力 F_pu ≈ 4,950 kN，有效預力 0.60F_pu ≈ 2,970 kN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 19-strand tendon has A_ps = 19×140 = 2,660 mm² and f_pu = 1,860 MPa, so F_pu ≈ 4,950 kN and the effective prestress 0.60F_pu ≈ 2,970 kN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b055-v13-11","title":"鋼絞線腐蝕與殘餘強度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Strand corrosion and residual strength: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「灌漿空隙與泌水」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Grout voids and bleed water” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在鋼腱高點、錨頭後方與轉向塊兩側鑽小孔，以內視鏡觀察空隙與鋼絲表面，取灌漿樣本做氯離子、硫酸根、含水率與碳化試驗；鋼絲樣本則量測截面損失與腐蝕型態，每一筆結果都標註到鋼腱編號與位置。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Drill small holes at tendon high points, behind anchorages and on both sides of deviators, inspect voids and wire surfaces with a borescope, and test grout samples for chloride, sulfate, moisture content and carbonation; measure section loss and corrosion morphology on wire samples, and tag every result to the tendon number and location. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：檢測取樣要涵蓋高點、低點、錨頭與轉向處，並把排氣管與灌漿孔是否封閉列入每次巡檢；任何開放的排氣管或積水的錨頭帽都視為缺陷，限期封堵並追查同一灌漿批次的鋼腱。","observationEn":"Site practice: Sampling must cover high points, low points, anchorages and deviators, and every inspection should check that vents and grout ports are sealed; treat any open vent or water-filled anchor cap as a defect, seal it within a set deadline and investigate the tendons grouted in the same batch.","failure":"注意干擾：Wando River 橋第二次失效的鋼腱共 133 根鋼絲中，約 80.5% 因腐蝕斷裂，其餘在截面減少後因過載拉斷，顯示局部腐蝕累積到臨界點後，最後的斷裂是突發的；一支未封閉、通到橋面的灌漿排氣管把水引入隔梁，是調查確認的進水路徑。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: In the second Wando River Bridge failure, about 80.5% of the tendon's 133 wires had ruptured by corrosion and the rest by overstress on the reduced area, showing that once local corrosion reaches a threshold the final rupture is sudden; an open grout vent tube running up to the deck and carrying water into a diaphragm was a confirmed water path. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在鋼腱高點、錨頭後方與轉向塊兩側鑽小孔，以內視鏡觀察空隙與鋼絲表面，取灌漿樣本做氯離子、硫酸根、含水率與碳化試驗；鋼絲樣本則量測截面損失與腐蝕型態，每一筆結果都標註到鋼腱編號與位置。","textEn":"Drill small holes at tendon high points, behind anchorages and on both sides of deviators, inspect voids and wire surfaces with a borescope, and test grout samples for chloride, sulfate, moisture content and carbonation; measure section loss and corrosion morphology on wire samples, and tag every result to the tendon number and location.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"檢測取樣要涵蓋高點、低點、錨頭與轉向處，並把排氣管與灌漿孔是否封閉列入每次巡檢；任何開放的排氣管或積水的錨頭帽都視為缺陷，限期封堵並追查同一灌漿批次的鋼腱。","textEn":"Sampling must cover high points, low points, anchorages and deviators, and every inspection should check that vents and grout ports are sealed; treat any open vent or water-filled anchor cap as a defect, seal it within a set deadline and investigate the tendons grouted in the same batch.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「鋼絞線腐蝕與殘餘強度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Strand corrosion and residual strength\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","鋼腱更換完成後，這座橋的預力問題就徹底解決了。","在鋼腱高點、錨頭後方與轉向塊兩側鑽小孔，以內視鏡觀察空隙與鋼絲表面，取灌漿樣本做氯離子、硫酸根、含水率與碳化試驗。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Once tendons are replaced, the bridge's prestressing problems are solved for good.","Drill small holes at tendon high points, behind anchorages and on both sides of deviators, inspect voids and wire surfaces with a borescope, and test grout samples for chloride, sulfate, moisture content and carbonation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在鋼腱高點、錨頭後方與轉向塊兩側鑽小孔，以內視鏡觀察空隙與鋼絲表面，取灌漿樣本做氯離子、硫酸根、含水率與碳化試驗；鋼絲樣本則量測截面損失與腐蝕型態，每一筆結果都標註到鋼腱編號與位置。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Drill small holes at tendon high points, behind anchorages and on both sides of deviators, inspect voids and wire surfaces with a borescope, and test grout samples for chloride, sulfate, moisture content and carbonation; measure section loss and corrosion morphology on wire samples, and tag every result to the tendon number and location. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b055-v13-12","title":"鋼絞線腐蝕與殘餘強度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Strand corrosion and residual strength: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「灌漿空隙與泌水」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Grout voids and bleed water” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"Wando River 橋第二次失效的鋼腱共 133 根鋼絲中，約 80.5% 因腐蝕斷裂，其餘在截面減少後因過載拉斷，顯示局部腐蝕累積到臨界點後，最後的斷裂是突發的；一支未封閉、通到橋面的灌漿排氣管把水引入隔梁，是調查確認的進水路徑。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"In the second Wando River Bridge failure, about 80.5% of the tendon's 133 wires had ruptured by corrosion and the rest by overstress on the reduced area, showing that once local corrosion reaches a threshold the final rupture is sudden; an open grout vent tube running up to the deck and carrying water into a diaphragm was a confirmed water path. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：腐蝕常集中在少數鋼絞線，鋼絲先在局部斷裂，灌漿又把附近未斷的鋼絲綁在一起，使殘存鋼絲在斷點附近承擔更高應力。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Corrosion usually concentrates in a few strands, wires break locally, and the grout ties nearby intact wires together so that the survivors carry higher stress near the break.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要灌漿的氯離子含量很低，鋼腱就不會腐蝕。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If grout chloride content is very low, the tendon cannot corrode.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"Wando River 橋第二次失效的鋼腱共 133 根鋼絲中，約 80.5% 因腐蝕斷裂，其餘在截面減少後因過載拉斷，顯示局部腐蝕累積到臨界點後，最後的斷裂是突發的；一支未封閉、通到橋面的灌漿排氣管把水引入隔梁，是調查確認的進水路徑。","textEn":"In the second Wando River Bridge failure, about 80.5% of the tendon's 133 wires had ruptured by corrosion and the rest by overstress on the reduced area, showing that once local corrosion reaches a threshold the final rupture is sudden; an open grout vent tube running up to the deck and carrying water into a diaphragm was a confirmed water path.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「鋼絞線腐蝕與殘餘強度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Strand corrosion and residual strength\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["Wando River 橋第二次失效的鋼腱共 133 根鋼絲中，約 80.5% 因腐蝕斷裂，其餘在截面減少後因過載拉斷，顯示局部腐蝕累積到臨界點後，最後的斷裂是突發的。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","外置鋼腱因為看得到，天生就可以更換，不需要特別的細部。"],"optionsEn":["In the second Wando River Bridge failure, about 80.5% of the tendon's 133 wires had ruptured by corrosion and the rest by overstress on the reduced area, showing that once local corrosion reaches a threshold the final rupture is sudden.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Because external tendons are visible, they are inherently replaceable without special detailing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"Wando River 橋第二次失效的鋼腱共 133 根鋼絲中，約 80.5% 因腐蝕斷裂，其餘在截面減少後因過載拉斷，顯示局部腐蝕累積到臨界點後，最後的斷裂是突發的；一支未封閉、通到橋面的灌漿排氣管把水引入隔梁，是調查確認的進水路徑。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"In the second Wando River Bridge failure, about 80.5% of the tendon's 133 wires had ruptured by corrosion and the rest by overstress on the reduced area, showing that once local corrosion reaches a threshold the final rupture is sudden; an open grout vent tube running up to the deck and carrying water into a diaphragm was a confirmed water path. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b055-v13-13","title":"可更換鋼腱的細部設計：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Detailing for replaceable tendons: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-12"],"objective":"說明「雙層包覆與擴口轉向」如何影響橋梁預力鋼腱更換的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Double envelope and diabolo” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge prestressing-tendon replacement”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"傳統做法在轉向塊與隔梁內埋設剛性鋼管，再以套管接上外露的 HDPE 套管並一起灌漿；更換時灌漿把鋼腱與鋼管黏成一體，抽出時常損壞混凝土。FHWA 2019 年的可更換灌漿外置鋼腱指引提出「雙層包覆」概念：在轉向塊與隔梁內以喇叭狀的擴口模形成空腔，讓鋼腱連同套管只靠承壓傳力、不與混凝土黏結，錨頭也用導管或雙喇叭管隔開，舊鋼腱可以整條抽出。AASHTO LRFD 節塊橋條文另要求預留臨時與未來追加鋼腱的錨座與孔道，作為更換期間或日後補強的備援。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「雙層包覆與擴口轉向」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Traditional details embed rigid steel pipes in deviators and diaphragms, couple them to exposed HDPE duct and grout everything together; on replacement the grout binds tendon and pipe into one piece, so extraction often damages the concrete. FHWA's 2019 guide on replaceable grouted external tendons proposes a double-envelope concept: trumpet-shaped diabolo voids in deviators and diaphragms let the tendon and its duct transfer force by bearing only, with no bond to the concrete, and guide pipes or double trumpets isolate the anchorages, so the old tendon can be pulled out whole. AASHTO LRFD segmental provisions also require provisional and future tendon anchorages and ducts, which serve as a reserve during replacement or later strengthening. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Double envelope and diabolo” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：FHWA 指引建議擴口出口角 = 轉向角 + 3°。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The FHWA guide recommends a diabolo exit angle equal to the deviation angle plus 3°.","failure":"常見誤解：「外置鋼腱因為看得到，天生就可以更換，不需要特別的細部。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Because external tendons are visible, they are inherently replaceable without special detailing.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「雙層包覆與擴口轉向」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Double envelope and diabolo”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-13-k1","title":"可更換鋼腱的細部設計","titleEn":"Detailing for replaceable tendons","text":"傳統做法在轉向塊與隔梁內埋設剛性鋼管，再以套管接上外露的 HDPE 套管並一起灌漿；更換時灌漿把鋼腱與鋼管黏成一體，抽出時常損壞混凝土。FHWA 2019 年的可更換灌漿外置鋼腱指引提出「雙層包覆」概念：在轉向塊與隔梁內以喇叭狀的擴口模形成空腔，讓鋼腱連同套管只靠承壓傳力、不與混凝土黏結，錨頭也用導管或雙喇叭管隔開，舊鋼腱可以整條抽出。","textEn":"Traditional details embed rigid steel pipes in deviators and diaphragms, couple them to exposed HDPE duct and grout everything together; on replacement the grout binds tendon and pipe into one piece, so extraction often damages the concrete. FHWA's 2019 guide on replaceable grouted external tendons proposes a double-envelope concept: trumpet-shaped diabolo voids in deviators and diaphragms let the tendon and its duct transfer force by bearing only, with no bond to the concrete, and guide pipes or double trumpets isolate the anchorages, so the old tendon can be pulled out whole.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：外置鋼腱因為看得到，天生就可以更換，不需要特別的細部。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Because external tendons are visible, they are inherently replaceable without special detailing. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「可更換鋼腱的細部設計」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Detailing for replaceable tendons\" is correct?","options":["外置鋼腱因為看得到，天生就可以更換，不需要特別的細部。","傳統做法在轉向塊與隔梁內埋設剛性鋼管，再以套管接上外露的 HDPE 套管並一起灌漿；更換時灌漿把鋼腱與鋼管黏成一體，抽出時常損壞混凝土。","鋼腱已經斷了一部分，剩下的鋼絞線可以直接在錨頭燒斷。"],"optionsEn":["Because external tendons are visible, they are inherently replaceable without special detailing.","Traditional details embed rigid steel pipes in deviators and diaphragms, couple them to exposed HDPE duct and grout everything together.","Once part of a tendon has broken, the remaining strands can simply be torched off at the anchorage."],"answer":1,"explanation":"傳統做法在轉向塊與隔梁內埋設剛性鋼管，再以套管接上外露的 HDPE 套管並一起灌漿；更換時灌漿把鋼腱與鋼管黏成一體，抽出時常損壞混凝土。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Traditional details embed rigid steel pipes in deviators and diaphragms, couple them to exposed HDPE duct and grout everything together; on replacement the grout binds tendon and pipe into one piece, so extraction often damages the concrete. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b055-v13-14","title":"可更換鋼腱的細部設計：定量估算","titleEn":"Detailing for replaceable tendons: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「雙層包覆與擴口轉向」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Double envelope and diabolo” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：FHWA 指引建議擴口出口角 = 轉向角 + 3°。轉向角 6° 時出口角取 9°；19 股鋼腱最小轉向半徑約 9.8 ft（約 3.0 m），弧長 s = R·θ = 3.0×(9×π/180) ≈ 0.47 m。若一跨六條鋼腱總力 17.82 MN，臨時預力容量至少 5%，約 0.89 MN。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The FHWA guide recommends a diabolo exit angle equal to the deviation angle plus 3°. For a 6° deviation the exit angle is 9°; with a minimum deviator radius of about 9.8 ft (about 3.0 m) for a 19-strand tendon, the arc length is s = R·θ = 3.0×(9×π/180) ≈ 0.47 m. For six tendons totalling 17.82 MN in a span, a provisional capacity of at least 5% is about 0.89 MN. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：設計審查時逐一核對擴口半徑、出口角與內徑（FHWA 建議內徑至少比套管外徑大 1/2 in），並以足尺試體或首件施作證明可以抽出；施工時量測擴口模成形面的平整度，檢查是否有超過 1/8 in 的凸起會刮傷套管。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: In design review, check each diabolo's radius, exit angle and inside diameter (FHWA recommends at least 1/2 in larger than the duct outside diameter), and prove extraction with a full-scale mock-up or first-article trial; during construction, survey the formed surfaces for irregularities above 1/8 in that would scrape the duct.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"FHWA 指引建議擴口出口角 = 轉向角 + 3°。轉向角 6° 時出口角取 9°；19 股鋼腱最小轉向半徑約 9.8 ft（約 3.0 m），弧長 s = R·θ = 3.0×(9×π/180) ≈ 0.47 m。若一跨六條鋼腱總力 17.82 MN，臨時預力容量至少 5%，約 0.89 MN。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"The FHWA guide recommends a diabolo exit angle equal to the deviation angle plus 3°. For a 6° deviation the exit angle is 9°; with a minimum deviator radius of about 9.8 ft (about 3.0 m) for a 19-strand tendon, the arc length is s = R·θ = 3.0×(9×π/180) ≈ 0.47 m. For six tendons totalling 17.82 MN in a span, a provisional capacity of at least 5% is about 0.89 MN. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「可更換鋼腱的細部設計」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Detailing for replaceable tendons\", which statement holds?","options":["只要套管外觀沒有裂縫，裡面的鋼腱就一定完好。","真空灌注可以讓已腐蝕的鋼腱恢復原來的強度。","FHWA 指引建議擴口出口角 = 轉向角 + 3°。"],"optionsEn":["If the duct shows no cracks outside, the tendon inside must be sound.","Vacuum injection restores a corroded tendon to its original strength.","The FHWA guide recommends a diabolo exit angle equal to the deviation angle plus 3°."],"answer":2,"explanation":"FHWA 指引建議擴口出口角 = 轉向角 + 3°。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The FHWA guide recommends a diabolo exit angle equal to the deviation angle plus 3°. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b055-v13-15","title":"可更換鋼腱的細部設計：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Detailing for replaceable tendons: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「雙層包覆與擴口轉向」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Double envelope and diabolo” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"設計審查時逐一核對擴口半徑、出口角與內徑（FHWA 建議內徑至少比套管外徑大 1/2 in），並以足尺試體或首件施作證明可以抽出；施工時量測擴口模成形面的平整度，檢查是否有超過 1/8 in 的凸起會刮傷套管。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"In design review, check each diabolo's radius, exit angle and inside diameter (FHWA recommends at least 1/2 in larger than the duct outside diameter), and prove extraction with a full-scale mock-up or first-article trial; during construction, survey the formed surfaces for irregularities above 1/8 in that would scrape the duct. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：圖說要標示每條鋼腱張拉端與固定端的淨空：FHWA 指引引用千斤頂端部淨空約 6 至 7 ft、固定端至少 2 ft 6 in；箱室內的照明、排水管與檢查走道不得佔用這些空間。","observationEn":"Site practice: Show the stressing-end and dead-end clearances of every tendon on the drawings: the FHWA guide cites a jack envelope of about 6 to 7 ft at the stressing end and at least 2 ft 6 in at the dead end, and box-cell lighting, drain pipes and inspection walkways must not intrude into these spaces.","failure":"注意干擾：若轉向塊內的鋼管與灌漿成為一體，更換時只能以鑿除或鑽心方式取出舊鋼腱，轉向塊被削弱、鋼筋外露，新鋼腱只好改走外加的轉向座，工期與交通管制都大幅延長。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If the pipe and grout inside a deviator act as one piece, the old tendon can only be removed by chipping or coring, weakening the deviator and exposing reinforcement; the new tendon then has to run over an added deviation saddle, greatly extending the work and the traffic management. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"設計審查時逐一核對擴口半徑、出口角與內徑（FHWA 建議內徑至少比套管外徑大 1/2 in），並以足尺試體或首件施作證明可以抽出；施工時量測擴口模成形面的平整度，檢查是否有超過 1/8 in 的凸起會刮傷套管。","textEn":"In design review, check each diabolo's radius, exit angle and inside diameter (FHWA recommends at least 1/2 in larger than the duct outside diameter), and prove extraction with a full-scale mock-up or first-article trial; during construction, survey the formed surfaces for irregularities above 1/8 in that would scrape the duct.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"圖說要標示每條鋼腱張拉端與固定端的淨空：FHWA 指引引用千斤頂端部淨空約 6 至 7 ft、固定端至少 2 ft 6 in；箱室內的照明、排水管與檢查走道不得佔用這些空間。","textEn":"Show the stressing-end and dead-end clearances of every tendon on the drawings: the FHWA guide cites a jack envelope of about 6 to 7 ft at the stressing end and at least 2 ft 6 in at the dead end, and box-cell lighting, drain pipes and inspection walkways must not intrude into these spaces.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「可更換鋼腱的細部設計」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Detailing for replaceable tendons\"?","options":["設計審查時逐一核對擴口半徑、出口角與內徑（FHWA 建議內徑至少比套管外徑大 1/2 in），並以足尺試體或首件施作證明可以抽出。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","外置鋼腱斷一條只影響斷點附近，其餘跨段照常有預力。"],"optionsEn":["In design review, check each diabolo's radius, exit angle and inside diameter (FHWA recommends at least 1/2 in larger than the duct outside diameter), and prove extraction with a full-scale mock-up or first-article trial.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","When one external tendon breaks, only the region near the break loses prestress."],"answer":0,"explanation":"設計審查時逐一核對擴口半徑、出口角與內徑（FHWA 建議內徑至少比套管外徑大 1/2 in），並以足尺試體或首件施作證明可以抽出；施工時量測擴口模成形面的平整度，檢查是否有超過 1/8 in 的凸起會刮傷套管。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"In design review, check each diabolo's radius, exit angle and inside diameter (FHWA recommends at least 1/2 in larger than the duct outside diameter), and prove extraction with a full-scale mock-up or first-article trial; during construction, survey the formed surfaces for irregularities above 1/8 in that would scrape the duct. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b055-v13-16","title":"可更換鋼腱的細部設計：失效診斷","titleEn":"Detailing for replaceable tendons: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「雙層包覆與擴口轉向」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Double envelope and diabolo” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若轉向塊內的鋼管與灌漿成為一體，更換時只能以鑿除或鑽心方式取出舊鋼腱，轉向塊被削弱、鋼筋外露，新鋼腱只好改走外加的轉向座，工期與交通管制都大幅延長。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If the pipe and grout inside a deviator act as one piece, the old tendon can only be removed by chipping or coring, weakening the deviator and exposing reinforcement; the new tendon then has to run over an added deviation saddle, greatly extending the work and the traffic management. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：AASHTO LRFD 節塊橋條文另要求預留臨時與未來追加鋼腱的錨座與孔道，作為更換期間或日後補強的備援。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: AASHTO LRFD segmental provisions also require provisional and future tendon anchorages and ducts, which serve as a reserve during replacement or later strengthening.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「外置鋼腱因為看得到，天生就可以更換，不需要特別的細部。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Because external tendons are visible, they are inherently replaceable without special detailing.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若轉向塊內的鋼管與灌漿成為一體，更換時只能以鑿除或鑽心方式取出舊鋼腱，轉向塊被削弱、鋼筋外露，新鋼腱只好改走外加的轉向座，工期與交通管制都大幅延長。","textEn":"If the pipe and grout inside a deviator act as one piece, the old tendon can only be removed by chipping or coring, weakening the deviator and exposing reinforcement; the new tendon then has to run over an added deviation saddle, greatly extending the work and the traffic management.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「可更換鋼腱的細部設計」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Detailing for replaceable tendons\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","若轉向塊內的鋼管與灌漿成為一體，更換時只能以鑿除或鑽心方式取出舊鋼腱，轉向塊被削弱、鋼筋外露，新鋼腱只好改走外加的轉向座，工期與交通管制都大幅延長。","鋼腱已經斷了一部分，剩下的鋼絞線可以直接在錨頭燒斷。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","If the pipe and grout inside a deviator act as one piece, the old tendon can only be removed by chipping or coring, weakening the deviator and exposing reinforcement.","Once part of a tendon has broken, the remaining strands can simply be torched off at the anchorage."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若轉向塊內的鋼管與灌漿成為一體，更換時只能以鑿除或鑽心方式取出舊鋼腱，轉向塊被削弱、鋼筋外露，新鋼腱只好改走外加的轉向座，工期與交通管制都大幅延長。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the pipe and grout inside a deviator act as one piece, the old tendon can only be removed by chipping or coring, weakening the deviator and exposing reinforcement; the new tendon then has to run over an added deviation saddle, greatly extending the work and the traffic management. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b055-v13-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「舊鋼腱去張與能量釋放」與「新鋼腱張拉與伸長量控制」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Detensioning and energy release\" and \"Stressing the new tendon and elongation control\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b055-v13-17","title":"舊鋼腱去張與能量釋放：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Detensioning and energy release: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-16"],"objective":"說明「逐股切斷與夾具」如何影響橋梁預力鋼腱更換的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Strand-by-strand cutting and clamps” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge prestressing-tendon replacement”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"仍帶殘餘力的鋼腱儲存大量彈性能，若直接在錨頭燒斷楔片，鋼絞線與楔片可能從錨頭後方彈出。FDOT 在 2000 年處理 Mid-Bay 第 28 跨殘餘力約 500 kips 的鋼腱時，先剝除套管與灌漿，每約 4 ft 裝一組 U 型螺栓夾具限制甩動，再以電動砂輪機在錨頭與轉向處交替逐股切斷，使轉向塊兩側不平衡的斷股不超過一股，最後以 20,000 psi 水刀與單股千斤頂取出殘段。灌漿把鋼絲局部綁在一起，每切一股，鄰近鋼絲的應力就上升，因此切斷順序必須事先分析。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「逐股切斷與夾具」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A tendon with residual force stores large elastic energy, and burning out wedges at the anchorage can eject strands and wedges out of the back of the anchor. In 2000, dealing with a Mid-Bay span 28 tendon still carrying about 500 kips, FDOT removed the duct and grout, fitted U-bolt clamps about every 4 ft to restrain whip, cut strands one at a time with an electric abrasive saw, alternating between anchorage and deviator so that no more than one cut strand was out of balance across a deviator, then removed the remnants with a 20,000 psi water jet and a monostrand jack. Because grout ties wires together locally, each cut raises the stress in neighbouring wires, so the cutting sequence must be analysed beforehand. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Strand-by-strand cutting and clamps” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：單股彈性能 U = P²L/(2EA)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Elastic energy in one strand is U = P²L/(2EA).","failure":"常見誤解：「鋼腱已經斷了一部分，剩下的鋼絞線可以直接在錨頭燒斷。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once part of a tendon has broken, the remaining strands can simply be torched off at the anchorage.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「逐股切斷與夾具」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Strand-by-strand cutting and clamps”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-17-k1","title":"舊鋼腱去張與能量釋放","titleEn":"Detensioning and energy release","text":"仍帶殘餘力的鋼腱儲存大量彈性能，若直接在錨頭燒斷楔片，鋼絞線與楔片可能從錨頭後方彈出。FDOT 在 2000 年處理 Mid-Bay 第 28 跨殘餘力約 500 kips 的鋼腱時，先剝除套管與灌漿，每約 4 ft 裝一組 U 型螺栓夾具限制甩動，再以電動砂輪機在錨頭與轉向處交替逐股切斷，使轉向塊兩側不平衡的斷股不超過一股，最後以 20,000 psi 水刀與單股千斤頂取出殘段。","textEn":"A tendon with residual force stores large elastic energy, and burning out wedges at the anchorage can eject strands and wedges out of the back of the anchor. In 2000, dealing with a Mid-Bay span 28 tendon still carrying about 500 kips, FDOT removed the duct and grout, fitted U-bolt clamps about every 4 ft to restrain whip, cut strands one at a time with an electric abrasive saw, alternating between anchorage and deviator so that no more than one cut strand was out of balance across a deviator, then removed the remnants with a 20,000 psi water jet and a monostrand jack.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：鋼腱已經斷了一部分，剩下的鋼絞線可以直接在錨頭燒斷。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once part of a tendon has broken, the remaining strands can simply be torched off at the anchorage. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「舊鋼腱去張與能量釋放」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Detensioning and energy release\" is correct?","options":["鋼腱已經斷了一部分，剩下的鋼絞線可以直接在錨頭燒斷。","千斤頂油壓達到目標值，就證明整條鋼腱的力量都正確。","仍帶殘餘力的鋼腱儲存大量彈性能，若直接在錨頭燒斷楔片，鋼絞線與楔片可能從錨頭後方彈出。"],"optionsEn":["Once part of a tendon has broken, the remaining strands can simply be torched off at the anchorage.","Reaching the target jack pressure proves the force is correct along the whole tendon.","A tendon with residual force stores large elastic energy, and burning out wedges at the anchorage can eject strands and wedges out of the back of the anchor."],"answer":2,"explanation":"仍帶殘餘力的鋼腱儲存大量彈性能，若直接在錨頭燒斷楔片，鋼絞線與楔片可能從錨頭後方彈出。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A tendon with residual force stores large elastic energy, and burning out wedges at the anchorage can eject strands and wedges out of the back of the anchor. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b055-v13-18","title":"舊鋼腱去張與能量釋放：定量估算","titleEn":"Detensioning and energy release: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「逐股切斷與夾具」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Strand-by-strand cutting and clamps” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：單股彈性能 U = P²L/(2EA)。取每股 156 kN、自由長度 60 m、E = 195 GPa、A = 140 mm²：U = 156,000²×60/(2×195×10⁹×140×10⁻⁶) ≈ 26.7 kJ；整條 19 股、2,970 kN 約 510 kJ。理想化地假設夾具能鎖住鋼絞線，切斷時參與彈出的只剩夾具間 1.2 m，釋放能量約 0.53 kJ。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Elastic energy in one strand is U = P²L/(2EA). With 156 kN per strand, a free length of 60 m, E = 195 GPa and A = 140 mm², U = 156,000²×60/(2×195×10⁹×140×10⁻⁶) ≈ 26.7 kJ; the whole 19-strand tendon at 2,970 kN stores about 510 kJ. Idealising that the clamps lock the strand, only the 1.2 m between clamps takes part in the recoil, releasing about 0.53 kJ. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：去張前以分析確認每次切斷後殘存鋼絲的應力：FDOT 的分析指出，若灌漿局部鎖住且連續切斷，約 7 次後殘存鋼絞線降伏、約 15 次達極限。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before detensioning, analyse the stress in the surviving wires after each cut: FDOT's analysis showed that with grout locking strands locally and consecutive cuts, survivors would yield after about 7 cuts and reach ultimate after about 15.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"單股彈性能 U = P²L/(2EA)。取每股 156 kN、自由長度 60 m、E = 195 GPa、A = 140 mm²：U = 156,000²×60/(2×195×10⁹×140×10⁻⁶) ≈ 26.7 kJ；整條 19 股、2,970 kN 約 510 kJ。理想化地假設夾具能鎖住鋼絞線，切斷時參與彈出的只剩夾具間 1.2 m，釋放能量約 0.53 kJ。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Elastic energy in one strand is U = P²L/(2EA). With 156 kN per strand, a free length of 60 m, E = 195 GPa and A = 140 mm², U = 156,000²×60/(2×195×10⁹×140×10⁻⁶) ≈ 26.7 kJ; the whole 19-strand tendon at 2,970 kN stores about 510 kJ. Idealising that the clamps lock the strand, only the 1.2 m between clamps takes part in the recoil, releasing about 0.53 kJ. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「舊鋼腱去張與能量釋放」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Detensioning and energy release\", which statement holds?","options":["單股彈性能 U = P²L/(2EA)。","鋼腱振動頻率只要有變化，就一定是斷了鋼絲。","鋼腱更換完成後，這座橋的預力問題就徹底解決了。"],"optionsEn":["Elastic energy in one strand is U = P²L/(2EA).","Any change in a tendon's vibration frequency must mean broken wires.","Once tendons are replaced, the bridge's prestressing problems are solved for good."],"answer":0,"explanation":"單股彈性能 U = P²L/(2EA)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Elastic energy in one strand is U = P²L/(2EA). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b055-v13-19","title":"舊鋼腱去張與能量釋放：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Detensioning and energy release: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「逐股切斷與夾具」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Strand-by-strand cutting and clamps” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"去張前以分析確認每次切斷後殘存鋼絲的應力：FDOT 的分析指出，若灌漿局部鎖住且連續切斷，約 7 次後殘存鋼絞線降伏、約 15 次達極限。現場依切斷順序表、夾具扭力紀錄與人員禁入區逐項簽核，並在錨頭後方設置鋼製擋板。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before detensioning, analyse the stress in the surviving wires after each cut: FDOT's analysis showed that with grout locking strands locally and consecutive cuts, survivors would yield after about 7 cuts and reach ultimate after about 15. On site, sign off the cutting-sequence sheet, clamp torque records and personnel exclusion zones item by item, and install a steel containment plate behind the anchorage. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：去張屬高能量釋放的危險作業，施工計畫須列出切斷順序、夾具間距、人員禁入區與停止條件，由業主、審查工程師與承包商安全主管共同核准後才能開始；本課只說明檢核邏輯，不構成作業許可。","observationEn":"Site practice: Detensioning is a hazardous high-energy operation: the method statement must list the cutting sequence, clamp spacing, exclusion zones and stop criteria, and be approved jointly by the owner, the checking engineer and the contractor's safety lead before work starts; this course explains the checking logic only and is not an operating permit.","failure":"注意干擾：在箱梁內以火焰燒斷鋼腱，部分加熱的鋼材仍帶應力且通風不良；若順序失衡，在同一側連續切斷，會對轉向塊施加不平衡力，使轉向塊開裂或埋設鋼管滑動。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Flame-cutting inside a box girder leaves partly heated steel still under stress in poor ventilation; an unbalanced sequence with consecutive cuts on one side applies unbalanced force to a deviator that can crack it or slide its embedded pipe. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"去張前以分析確認每次切斷後殘存鋼絲的應力：FDOT 的分析指出，若灌漿局部鎖住且連續切斷，約 7 次後殘存鋼絞線降伏、約 15 次達極限。現場依切斷順序表、夾具扭力紀錄與人員禁入區逐項簽核，並在錨頭後方設置鋼製擋板。","textEn":"Before detensioning, analyse the stress in the surviving wires after each cut: FDOT's analysis showed that with grout locking strands locally and consecutive cuts, survivors would yield after about 7 cuts and reach ultimate after about 15. On site, sign off the cutting-sequence sheet, clamp torque records and personnel exclusion zones item by item, and install a steel containment plate behind the anchorage.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"去張屬高能量釋放的危險作業，施工計畫須列出切斷順序、夾具間距、人員禁入區與停止條件，由業主、審查工程師與承包商安全主管共同核准後才能開始；本課只說明檢核邏輯，不構成作業許可。","textEn":"Detensioning is a hazardous high-energy operation: the method statement must list the cutting sequence, clamp spacing, exclusion zones and stop criteria, and be approved jointly by the owner, the checking engineer and the contractor's safety lead before work starts; this course explains the checking logic only and is not an operating permit.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「舊鋼腱去張與能量釋放」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Detensioning and energy release\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","去張前以分析確認每次切斷後殘存鋼絲的應力：FDOT 的分析指出，若灌漿局部鎖住且連續切斷，約 7 次後殘存鋼絞線降伏、約 15 次達極限。","只要其餘鋼腱沒斷，更換期間的橋就和平常一樣安全。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Before detensioning, analyse the stress in the surviving wires after each cut: FDOT's analysis showed that with grout locking strands locally and consecutive cuts, survivors would yield after about 7 cuts and reach ultimate after about 15.","As long as the other tendons are intact, the bridge is as safe as usual during a replacement."],"answer":1,"explanation":"去張前以分析確認每次切斷後殘存鋼絲的應力：FDOT 的分析指出，若灌漿局部鎖住且連續切斷，約 7 次後殘存鋼絞線降伏、約 15 次達極限。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before detensioning, analyse the stress in the surviving wires after each cut: FDOT's analysis showed that with grout locking strands locally and consecutive cuts, survivors would yield after about 7 cuts and reach ultimate after about 15. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b055-v13-20","title":"舊鋼腱去張與能量釋放：失效診斷","titleEn":"Detensioning and energy release: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「逐股切斷與夾具」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Strand-by-strand cutting and clamps” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"在箱梁內以火焰燒斷鋼腱，部分加熱的鋼材仍帶應力且通風不良；若順序失衡，在同一側連續切斷，會對轉向塊施加不平衡力，使轉向塊開裂或埋設鋼管滑動。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Flame-cutting inside a box girder leaves partly heated steel still under stress in poor ventilation; an unbalanced sequence with consecutive cuts on one side applies unbalanced force to a deviator that can crack it or slide its embedded pipe. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：灌漿把鋼絲局部綁在一起，每切一股，鄰近鋼絲的應力就上升，因此切斷順序必須事先分析。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Because grout ties wires together locally, each cut raises the stress in neighbouring wires, so the cutting sequence must be analysed beforehand.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「鋼腱已經斷了一部分，剩下的鋼絞線可以直接在錨頭燒斷。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once part of a tendon has broken, the remaining strands can simply be torched off at the anchorage.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"在箱梁內以火焰燒斷鋼腱，部分加熱的鋼材仍帶應力且通風不良；若順序失衡，在同一側連續切斷，會對轉向塊施加不平衡力，使轉向塊開裂或埋設鋼管滑動。","textEn":"Flame-cutting inside a box girder leaves partly heated steel still under stress in poor ventilation; an unbalanced sequence with consecutive cuts on one side applies unbalanced force to a deviator that can crack it or slide its embedded pipe.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「舊鋼腱去張與能量釋放」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Detensioning and energy release\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","千斤頂油壓達到目標值，就證明整條鋼腱的力量都正確。","在箱梁內以火焰燒斷鋼腱，部分加熱的鋼材仍帶應力且通風不良；若順序失衡，在同一側連續切斷，會對轉向塊施加不平衡力，使轉向塊開裂或埋設鋼管滑動。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Reaching the target jack pressure proves the force is correct along the whole tendon.","Flame-cutting inside a box girder leaves partly heated steel still under stress in poor ventilation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在箱梁內以火焰燒斷鋼腱，部分加熱的鋼材仍帶應力且通風不良；若順序失衡，在同一側連續切斷，會對轉向塊施加不平衡力，使轉向塊開裂或埋設鋼管滑動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Flame-cutting inside a box girder leaves partly heated steel still under stress in poor ventilation; an unbalanced sequence with consecutive cuts on one side applies unbalanced force to a deviator that can crack it or slide its embedded pipe. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b055-v13-21","title":"新鋼腱張拉與伸長量控制：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Stressing the new tendon and elongation control: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-20"],"objective":"說明「千斤頂讀值與伸長量」如何影響橋梁預力鋼腱更換的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Jack pressure and elongation” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge prestressing-tendon replacement”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"新鋼腱穿入原路線後，以多股千斤頂從張拉端施加預力，力量沿路線經過每一處轉向時因摩擦而遞減。張拉採「力量與伸長量雙重核對」：千斤頂油壓換算的力量決定目標，量到的伸長量則反映鋼材彈性模數、摩擦與錨定滑移是否符合假設。外置鋼腱長度可達百公尺以上，伸長量常超過千斤頂行程，需要多次回程，每次回程的楔片咬合都會損失少許伸長量。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「千斤頂讀值與伸長量」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"After the new tendon is threaded along the original path, a multistrand jack applies force at the stressing end, and the force decays by friction at each deviator along the route. Stressing is controlled by a dual check of force and elongation: the jack pressure converted to force sets the target, while the measured elongation shows whether the steel modulus, friction and anchor set match the assumptions. External tendons can exceed a hundred metres, so elongation often exceeds the jack stroke and needs several restrokes, each wedge seating losing a little elongation. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Jack pressure and elongation” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：張拉力 P_j = 2,660 mm²×1,450 MPa ≈ 3,857 kN；μ = 0.25、總轉角 α = 0.20 rad，固定端 P = P_j·e^(−μα) ≈ 3,669 kN，平均約 3,763 kN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Jacking force P_j = 2,660 mm²×1,450 MPa ≈ 3,857 kN; with μ = 0.25 and total angle α = 0.20 rad, the dead-end force is P = P_j·e^(−μα) ≈ 3,669 kN and the average about 3,763 kN.","failure":"常見誤解：「千斤頂油壓達到目標值，就證明整條鋼腱的力量都正確。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Reaching the target jack pressure proves the force is correct along the whole tendon.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「千斤頂讀值與伸長量」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Jack pressure and elongation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-21-k1","title":"新鋼腱張拉與伸長量控制","titleEn":"Stressing the new tendon and elongation control","text":"新鋼腱穿入原路線後，以多股千斤頂從張拉端施加預力，力量沿路線經過每一處轉向時因摩擦而遞減。張拉採「力量與伸長量雙重核對」：千斤頂油壓換算的力量決定目標，量到的伸長量則反映鋼材彈性模數、摩擦與錨定滑移是否符合假設。","textEn":"After the new tendon is threaded along the original path, a multistrand jack applies force at the stressing end, and the force decays by friction at each deviator along the route. Stressing is controlled by a dual check of force and elongation: the jack pressure converted to force sets the target, while the measured elongation shows whether the steel modulus, friction and anchor set match the assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：千斤頂油壓達到目標值，就證明整條鋼腱的力量都正確。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Reaching the target jack pressure proves the force is correct along the whole tendon. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「新鋼腱張拉與伸長量控制」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Stressing the new tendon and elongation control\" is correct?","options":["新鋼腱穿入原路線後，以多股千斤頂從張拉端施加預力，力量沿路線經過每一處轉向時因摩擦而遞減。","千斤頂油壓達到目標值，就證明整條鋼腱的力量都正確。","只要套管外觀沒有裂縫，裡面的鋼腱就一定完好。"],"optionsEn":["After the new tendon is threaded along the original path, a multistrand jack applies force at the stressing end, and the force decays by friction at each deviator along the route.","Reaching the target jack pressure proves the force is correct along the whole tendon.","If the duct shows no cracks outside, the tendon inside must be sound."],"answer":0,"explanation":"新鋼腱穿入原路線後，以多股千斤頂從張拉端施加預力，力量沿路線經過每一處轉向時因摩擦而遞減。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"After the new tendon is threaded along the original path, a multistrand jack applies force at the stressing end, and the force decays by friction at each deviator along the route. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b055-v13-22","title":"新鋼腱張拉與伸長量控制：定量估算","titleEn":"Stressing the new tendon and elongation control: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「千斤頂讀值與伸長量」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Jack pressure and elongation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：張拉力 P_j = 2,660 mm²×1,450 MPa ≈ 3,857 kN；μ = 0.25、總轉角 α = 0.20 rad，固定端 P = P_j·e^(−μα) ≈ 3,669 kN，平均約 3,763 kN。L = 120 m、E = 195 GPa：ΔL = P_avg·L/(A·E) = 3,763,000×120/(2.66×10⁻³×195×10⁹) ≈ 0.87 m，千斤頂行程 250 mm 需約 4 次。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Jacking force P_j = 2,660 mm²×1,450 MPa ≈ 3,857 kN; with μ = 0.25 and total angle α = 0.20 rad, the dead-end force is P = P_j·e^(−μα) ≈ 3,669 kN and the average about 3,763 kN. For L = 120 m and E = 195 GPa, ΔL = P_avg·L/(A·E) = 3,763,000×120/(2.66×10⁻³×195×10⁹) ≈ 0.87 m, so a 250 mm jack stroke needs about 4 strokes. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：千斤頂與壓力錶必須在有效期限內以校正荷重計配對校正；張拉時分級記錄油壓與伸長量，扣除初始鬆弛段後外推實際伸長量，與計算值比較，差異超出規範允差（常見 ±5% 至 ±7%）時停工查明摩擦、卡住或鋼絞線滑移。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Jacks and gauges must be calibrated as a pair against a load cell within their validity period; record pressure and elongation in stages, extrapolate the true elongation after removing the initial slack range and compare it with the calculated value, stopping to investigate friction, binding or strand slip if the difference exceeds the specified tolerance, commonly ±5% to ±7%.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"張拉力 P_j = 2,660 mm²×1,450 MPa ≈ 3,857 kN；μ = 0.25、總轉角 α = 0.20 rad，固定端 P = P_j·e^(−μα) ≈ 3,669 kN，平均約 3,763 kN。L = 120 m、E = 195 GPa：ΔL = P_avg·L/(A·E) = 3,763,000×120/(2.66×10⁻³×195×10⁹) ≈ 0.87 m，千斤頂行程 250 mm 需約 4 次。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Jacking force P_j = 2,660 mm²×1,450 MPa ≈ 3,857 kN; with μ = 0.25 and total angle α = 0.20 rad, the dead-end force is P = P_j·e^(−μα) ≈ 3,669 kN and the average about 3,763 kN. For L = 120 m and E = 195 GPa, ΔL = P_avg·L/(A·E) = 3,763,000×120/(2.66×10⁻³×195×10⁹) ≈ 0.87 m, so a 250 mm jack stroke needs about 4 strokes. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「新鋼腱張拉與伸長量控制」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Stressing the new tendon and elongation control\", which statement holds?","options":["真空灌注可以讓已腐蝕的鋼腱恢復原來的強度。","張拉力 P_j = 2,660 mm²×1,450 MPa ≈ 3,857 kN。","外置鋼腱斷一條只影響斷點附近，其餘跨段照常有預力。"],"optionsEn":["Vacuum injection restores a corroded tendon to its original strength.","Jacking force P_j = 2,660 mm²×1,450 MPa ≈ 3,857 kN.","When one external tendon breaks, only the region near the break loses prestress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"張拉力 P_j = 2,660 mm²×1,450 MPa ≈ 3,857 kN；μ = 0.25、總轉角 α = 0.20 rad，固定端 P = P_j·e^(−μα) ≈ 3,669 kN，平均約 3,763 kN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Jacking force P_j = 2,660 mm²×1,450 MPa ≈ 3,857 kN; with μ = 0.25 and total angle α = 0.20 rad, the dead-end force is P = P_j·e^(−μα) ≈ 3,669 kN and the average about 3,763 kN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b055-v13-23","title":"新鋼腱張拉與伸長量控制：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Stressing the new tendon and elongation control: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「千斤頂讀值與伸長量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Jack pressure and elongation” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"千斤頂與壓力錶必須在有效期限內以校正荷重計配對校正；張拉時分級記錄油壓與伸長量，扣除初始鬆弛段後外推實際伸長量，與計算值比較，差異超出規範允差（常見 ±5% 至 ±7%）時停工查明摩擦、卡住或鋼絞線滑移。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Jacks and gauges must be calibrated as a pair against a load cell within their validity period; record pressure and elongation in stages, extrapolate the true elongation after removing the initial slack range and compare it with the calculated value, stopping to investigate friction, binding or strand slip if the difference exceeds the specified tolerance, commonly ±5% to ±7%. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：新鋼腱在灌漿或注入填充材前設置停留點：由監造確認伸長量紀錄、錨定滑移量與兩端力量，並保留至少一次再張拉的機會；若業主選用可再張拉的柔性填充材，須在交接文件寫明材料與再張拉程序。","observationEn":"Site practice: Set a hold point before the new tendon is grouted or filled: the resident engineer confirms the elongation record, anchor set and end forces, keeping at least one opportunity to restress; if the owner chooses a restressable flexible filler, record the material and restressing procedure in the handover documents.","failure":"注意干擾：若轉向處的套管在穿索時被刮破或擠扁，摩擦大增，張拉端達到目標力量但固定端力量不足，伸長量偏短；只看油壓的人會以為合格，實際上該跨預力不足，接縫底緣的壓應力儲備已被吃掉。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If the duct at a deviator was scraped or crushed during threading, friction rises sharply: the stressing end reaches its target force but the dead end is short and the elongation comes up low. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"千斤頂與壓力錶必須在有效期限內以校正荷重計配對校正；張拉時分級記錄油壓與伸長量，扣除初始鬆弛段後外推實際伸長量，與計算值比較，差異超出規範允差（常見 ±5% 至 ±7%）時停工查明摩擦、卡住或鋼絞線滑移。","textEn":"Jacks and gauges must be calibrated as a pair against a load cell within their validity period; record pressure and elongation in stages, extrapolate the true elongation after removing the initial slack range and compare it with the calculated value, stopping to investigate friction, binding or strand slip if the difference exceeds the specified tolerance, commonly ±5% to ±7%.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"新鋼腱在灌漿或注入填充材前設置停留點：由監造確認伸長量紀錄、錨定滑移量與兩端力量，並保留至少一次再張拉的機會；若業主選用可再張拉的柔性填充材，須在交接文件寫明材料與再張拉程序。","textEn":"Set a hold point before the new tendon is grouted or filled: the resident engineer confirms the elongation record, anchor set and end forces, keeping at least one opportunity to restress; if the owner chooses a restressable flexible filler, record the material and restressing procedure in the handover documents.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「新鋼腱張拉與伸長量控制」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Stressing the new tendon and elongation control\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","只要灌漿的氯離子含量很低，鋼腱就不會腐蝕。","千斤頂與壓力錶必須在有效期限內以校正荷重計配對校正。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","If grout chloride content is very low, the tendon cannot corrode.","Jacks and gauges must be calibrated as a pair against a load cell within their validity period."],"answer":2,"explanation":"千斤頂與壓力錶必須在有效期限內以校正荷重計配對校正；張拉時分級記錄油壓與伸長量，扣除初始鬆弛段後外推實際伸長量，與計算值比較，差異超出規範允差（常見 ±5% 至 ±7%）時停工查明摩擦、卡住或鋼絞線滑移。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Jacks and gauges must be calibrated as a pair against a load cell within their validity period; record pressure and elongation in stages, extrapolate the true elongation after removing the initial slack range and compare it with the calculated value, stopping to investigate friction, binding or strand slip if the difference exceeds the specified tolerance, commonly ±5% to ±7%. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b055-v13-24","title":"新鋼腱張拉與伸長量控制：失效診斷","titleEn":"Stressing the new tendon and elongation control: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「千斤頂讀值與伸長量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Jack pressure and elongation” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若轉向處的套管在穿索時被刮破或擠扁，摩擦大增，張拉端達到目標力量但固定端力量不足，伸長量偏短；只看油壓的人會以為合格，實際上該跨預力不足，接縫底緣的壓應力儲備已被吃掉。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If the duct at a deviator was scraped or crushed during threading, friction rises sharply: the stressing end reaches its target force but the dead end is short and the elongation comes up low. Anyone watching only the gauge would accept it, yet the span is under-prestressed and the joint compression reserve is gone. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：外置鋼腱長度可達百公尺以上，伸長量常超過千斤頂行程，需要多次回程，每次回程的楔片咬合都會損失少許伸長量。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: External tendons can exceed a hundred metres, so elongation often exceeds the jack stroke and needs several restrokes, each wedge seating losing a little elongation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「千斤頂油壓達到目標值，就證明整條鋼腱的力量都正確。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Reaching the target jack pressure proves the force is correct along the whole tendon.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若轉向處的套管在穿索時被刮破或擠扁，摩擦大增，張拉端達到目標力量但固定端力量不足，伸長量偏短；只看油壓的人會以為合格，實際上該跨預力不足，接縫底緣的壓應力儲備已被吃掉。","textEn":"If the duct at a deviator was scraped or crushed during threading, friction rises sharply: the stressing end reaches its target force but the dead end is short and the elongation comes up low. Anyone watching only the gauge would accept it, yet the span is under-prestressed and the joint compression reserve is gone.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「新鋼腱張拉與伸長量控制」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Stressing the new tendon and elongation control\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["若轉向處的套管在穿索時被刮破或擠扁，摩擦大增，張拉端達到目標力量但固定端力量不足，伸長量偏短。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","只要套管外觀沒有裂縫，裡面的鋼腱就一定完好。"],"optionsEn":["If the duct at a deviator was scraped or crushed during threading, friction rises sharply: the stressing end reaches its target force but the dead end is short and the elongation comes up low.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","If the duct shows no cracks outside, the tendon inside must be sound."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若轉向處的套管在穿索時被刮破或擠扁，摩擦大增，張拉端達到目標力量但固定端力量不足，伸長量偏短；只看油壓的人會以為合格，實際上該跨預力不足，接縫底緣的壓應力儲備已被吃掉。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the duct at a deviator was scraped or crushed during threading, friction rises sharply: the stressing end reaches its target force but the dead end is short and the elongation comes up low. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b055-v13-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「全橋鋼腱普查與抽樣」與「以振動估計鋼腱殘餘張力」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Network-wide tendon survey and sampling\" and \"Estimating residual tendon force by vibration\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b055-v13-25","title":"全橋鋼腱普查與抽樣：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Network-wide tendon survey and sampling: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-24"],"objective":"說明「磁通洩漏掃描與鑽孔內視鏡」如何影響橋梁預力鋼腱更換的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “MFL scans and borescope holes” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge prestressing-tendon replacement”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"發現一條鋼腱斷裂後，管理單位最需要知道的是還有多少條處於相同狀態。外露的外置鋼腱可用磁通洩漏（MFL）設備沿套管移動，偵測斷絲與截面損失造成的磁場擾動；被混凝土包住的錨頭與轉向段則需要鑽孔內視鏡、敲擊與取樣。2000 年 Mid-Bay 事件後，FDOT 以內視鏡檢查全部 1,728 個錨頭並使用 MFL，最後更換 846 條鋼腱中的 11 條。決定更換清單與優先順序的應是普查結果，而不只是已經斷的那一條。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「磁通洩漏掃描與鑽孔內視鏡」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"After one tendon breaks, the owner most needs to know how many others are in the same state. Exposed external tendons can be scanned by magnetic flux leakage (MFL) equipment moved along the duct, detecting field disturbances from wire breaks and section loss; anchorages and deviator zones hidden in concrete need borescope holes, sounding and sampling. After the 2000 Mid-Bay event FDOT borescoped all 1,728 anchorages and used MFL, eventually replacing 11 of 846 tendons. The survey, not just the broken tendon, should set the replacement list and priorities. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “MFL scans and borescope holes” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：若推估 p = 5% 的鋼腱帶有嚴重缺陷，隨機抽查 n 條至少找到一條的機率 P = 1 − (1 − p)ⁿ。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: If an estimated p = 5% of tendons carry a serious defect, the probability that a random sample of n finds at least one is P = 1 − (1 − p)ⁿ.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要套管外觀沒有裂縫，裡面的鋼腱就一定完好。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the duct shows no cracks outside, the tendon inside must be sound.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「磁通洩漏掃描與鑽孔內視鏡」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “MFL scans and borescope holes”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-25-k1","title":"全橋鋼腱普查與抽樣","titleEn":"Network-wide tendon survey and sampling","text":"發現一條鋼腱斷裂後，管理單位最需要知道的是還有多少條處於相同狀態。外露的外置鋼腱可用磁通洩漏（MFL）設備沿套管移動，偵測斷絲與截面損失造成的磁場擾動；被混凝土包住的錨頭與轉向段則需要鑽孔內視鏡、敲擊與取樣。","textEn":"After one tendon breaks, the owner most needs to know how many others are in the same state. Exposed external tendons can be scanned by magnetic flux leakage (MFL) equipment moved along the duct, detecting field disturbances from wire breaks and section loss; anchorages and deviator zones hidden in concrete need borescope holes, sounding and sampling.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要套管外觀沒有裂縫，裡面的鋼腱就一定完好。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the duct shows no cracks outside, the tendon inside must be sound. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「全橋鋼腱普查與抽樣」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Network-wide tendon survey and sampling\" is correct?","options":["只要套管外觀沒有裂縫，裡面的鋼腱就一定完好。","發現一條鋼腱斷裂後，管理單位最需要知道的是還有多少條處於相同狀態。","鋼腱振動頻率只要有變化，就一定是斷了鋼絲。"],"optionsEn":["If the duct shows no cracks outside, the tendon inside must be sound.","After one tendon breaks, the owner most needs to know how many others are in the same state.","Any change in a tendon's vibration frequency must mean broken wires."],"answer":1,"explanation":"發現一條鋼腱斷裂後，管理單位最需要知道的是還有多少條處於相同狀態。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"After one tendon breaks, the owner most needs to know how many others are in the same state. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b055-v13-26","title":"全橋鋼腱普查與抽樣：定量估算","titleEn":"Network-wide tendon survey and sampling: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「磁通洩漏掃描與鑽孔內視鏡」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “MFL scans and borescope holes” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：若推估 p = 5% 的鋼腱帶有嚴重缺陷，隨機抽查 n 條至少找到一條的機率 P = 1 − (1 − p)ⁿ。n = 60 時 P = 1 − 0.95⁶⁰ ≈ 1 − 0.046 = 95.4%；要達 99% 需 n = ln0.01/ln0.95 ≈ 90 條。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: If an estimated p = 5% of tendons carry a serious defect, the probability that a random sample of n finds at least one is P = 1 − (1 − p)ⁿ. For n = 60, P = 1 − 0.95⁶⁰ ≈ 1 − 0.046 = 95.4%; reaching 99% needs n = ln0.01/ln0.95 ≈ 90 tendons. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：MFL 需先在含已知缺陷的標定試體上確認可偵測的最小截面損失，現場訊號再與內視鏡或開窗結果交叉比對；抽樣計畫依 FHWA 灌漿缺陷指引的統計方法決定數量與位置，並偏重高點、錨頭與曾有漏水紀錄的節段。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Calibrate the MFL equipment on a specimen with known defects to confirm the smallest detectable section loss, then cross-check field signals against borescope or opened-window findings; set sample numbers and locations with the statistical approach in FHWA's grout-defect guidelines, weighted toward high points, anchorages and segments with a history of leakage.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"若推估 p = 5% 的鋼腱帶有嚴重缺陷，隨機抽查 n 條至少找到一條的機率 P = 1 − (1 − p)ⁿ。n = 60 時 P = 1 − 0.95⁶⁰ ≈ 1 − 0.046 = 95.4%；要達 99% 需 n = ln0.01/ln0.95 ≈ 90 條。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"If an estimated p = 5% of tendons carry a serious defect, the probability that a random sample of n finds at least one is P = 1 − (1 − p)ⁿ. For n = 60, P = 1 − 0.95⁶⁰ ≈ 1 − 0.046 = 95.4%; reaching 99% needs n = ln0.01/ln0.95 ≈ 90 tendons. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「全橋鋼腱普查與抽樣」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Network-wide tendon survey and sampling\", which statement holds?","options":["鋼腱更換完成後，這座橋的預力問題就徹底解決了。","只要其餘鋼腱沒斷，更換期間的橋就和平常一樣安全。","若推估 p = 5% 的鋼腱帶有嚴重缺陷，隨機抽查 n 條至少找到一條的機率 P = 1 − (1 − p)ⁿ。"],"optionsEn":["Once tendons are replaced, the bridge's prestressing problems are solved for good.","As long as the other tendons are intact, the bridge is as safe as usual during a replacement.","If an estimated p = 5% of tendons carry a serious defect, the probability that a random sample of n finds at least one is P = 1 − (1 − p)ⁿ."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若推估 p = 5% 的鋼腱帶有嚴重缺陷，隨機抽查 n 條至少找到一條的機率 P = 1 − (1 − p)ⁿ。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"If an estimated p = 5% of tendons carry a serious defect, the probability that a random sample of n finds at least one is P = 1 − (1 − p)ⁿ. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b055-v13-27","title":"全橋鋼腱普查與抽樣：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Network-wide tendon survey and sampling: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「磁通洩漏掃描與鑽孔內視鏡」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “MFL scans and borescope holes” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"MFL 需先在含已知缺陷的標定試體上確認可偵測的最小截面損失，現場訊號再與內視鏡或開窗結果交叉比對；抽樣計畫依 FHWA 灌漿缺陷指引的統計方法決定數量與位置，並偏重高點、錨頭與曾有漏水紀錄的節段。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Calibrate the MFL equipment on a specimen with known defects to confirm the smallest detectable section loss, then cross-check field signals against borescope or opened-window findings; set sample numbers and locations with the statistical approach in FHWA's grout-defect guidelines, weighted toward high points, anchorages and segments with a history of leakage. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：普查資料以鋼腱編號、跨號與錨頭編號建立唯一識別，並記錄每一個鑽孔的位置與封孔材料；所有檢測孔都必須以相容的灌漿或環氧樹脂封閉，避免檢查本身成為新的進水路徑。","observationEn":"Site practice: Index survey data by unique tendon, span and anchorage numbers and record every drilled hole's location and sealing material; seal all inspection holes with compatible grout or epoxy so the inspection itself does not create a new water path.","failure":"注意干擾：MFL 在錨頭、轉向鋼管與鋼筋密集處訊號會受干擾，若把「沒有訊號」當成「沒有缺陷」，最可能腐蝕的錨定區反而沒有被檢查；只做目視而不鑽孔，也看不到套管內的空隙與粉狀灌漿。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: MFL signals are disturbed at anchorages, deviator pipes and congested reinforcement, so treating no signal as no defect leaves the anchorage zones, where corrosion is most likely, unchecked; visual inspection without drilling cannot see voids and chalky grout inside the duct. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"MFL 需先在含已知缺陷的標定試體上確認可偵測的最小截面損失，現場訊號再與內視鏡或開窗結果交叉比對；抽樣計畫依 FHWA 灌漿缺陷指引的統計方法決定數量與位置，並偏重高點、錨頭與曾有漏水紀錄的節段。","textEn":"Calibrate the MFL equipment on a specimen with known defects to confirm the smallest detectable section loss, then cross-check field signals against borescope or opened-window findings; set sample numbers and locations with the statistical approach in FHWA's grout-defect guidelines, weighted toward high points, anchorages and segments with a history of leakage.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"普查資料以鋼腱編號、跨號與錨頭編號建立唯一識別，並記錄每一個鑽孔的位置與封孔材料；所有檢測孔都必須以相容的灌漿或環氧樹脂封閉，避免檢查本身成為新的進水路徑。","textEn":"Index survey data by unique tendon, span and anchorage numbers and record every drilled hole's location and sealing material; seal all inspection holes with compatible grout or epoxy so the inspection itself does not create a new water path.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「全橋鋼腱普查與抽樣」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Network-wide tendon survey and sampling\"?","options":["MFL 需先在含已知缺陷的標定試體上確認可偵測的最小截面損失，現場訊號再與內視鏡或開窗結果交叉比對。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","外置鋼腱因為看得到，天生就可以更換，不需要特別的細部。"],"optionsEn":["Calibrate the MFL equipment on a specimen with known defects to confirm the smallest detectable section loss, then cross-check field signals against borescope or opened-window findings.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Because external tendons are visible, they are inherently replaceable without special detailing."],"answer":0,"explanation":"MFL 需先在含已知缺陷的標定試體上確認可偵測的最小截面損失，現場訊號再與內視鏡或開窗結果交叉比對；抽樣計畫依 FHWA 灌漿缺陷指引的統計方法決定數量與位置，並偏重高點、錨頭與曾有漏水紀錄的節段。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Calibrate the MFL equipment on a specimen with known defects to confirm the smallest detectable section loss, then cross-check field signals against borescope or opened-window findings; set sample numbers and locations with the statistical approach in FHWA's grout-defect guidelines, weighted toward high points, anchorages and segments with a history of leakage. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b055-v13-28","title":"全橋鋼腱普查與抽樣：失效診斷","titleEn":"Network-wide tendon survey and sampling: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「磁通洩漏掃描與鑽孔內視鏡」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “MFL scans and borescope holes” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"MFL 在錨頭、轉向鋼管與鋼筋密集處訊號會受干擾，若把「沒有訊號」當成「沒有缺陷」，最可能腐蝕的錨定區反而沒有被檢查；只做目視而不鑽孔，也看不到套管內的空隙與粉狀灌漿。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"MFL signals are disturbed at anchorages, deviator pipes and congested reinforcement, so treating no signal as no defect leaves the anchorage zones, where corrosion is most likely, unchecked; visual inspection without drilling cannot see voids and chalky grout inside the duct. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：決定更換清單與優先順序的應是普查結果，而不只是已經斷的那一條。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The survey, not just the broken tendon, should set the replacement list and priorities.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要套管外觀沒有裂縫，裡面的鋼腱就一定完好。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the duct shows no cracks outside, the tendon inside must be sound.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"MFL 在錨頭、轉向鋼管與鋼筋密集處訊號會受干擾，若把「沒有訊號」當成「沒有缺陷」，最可能腐蝕的錨定區反而沒有被檢查；只做目視而不鑽孔，也看不到套管內的空隙與粉狀灌漿。","textEn":"MFL signals are disturbed at anchorages, deviator pipes and congested reinforcement, so treating no signal as no defect leaves the anchorage zones, where corrosion is most likely, unchecked; visual inspection without drilling cannot see voids and chalky grout inside the duct.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「全橋鋼腱普查與抽樣」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Network-wide tendon survey and sampling\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","MFL 在錨頭、轉向鋼管與鋼筋密集處訊號會受干擾，若把「沒有訊號」當成「沒有缺陷」，最可能腐蝕的錨定區反而沒有被檢查。","鋼腱振動頻率只要有變化，就一定是斷了鋼絲。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","MFL signals are disturbed at anchorages, deviator pipes and congested reinforcement, so treating no signal as no defect leaves the anchorage zones, where corrosion is most likely, unchecked.","Any change in a tendon's vibration frequency must mean broken wires."],"answer":1,"explanation":"MFL 在錨頭、轉向鋼管與鋼筋密集處訊號會受干擾，若把「沒有訊號」當成「沒有缺陷」，最可能腐蝕的錨定區反而沒有被檢查；只做目視而不鑽孔，也看不到套管內的空隙與粉狀灌漿。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"MFL signals are disturbed at anchorages, deviator pipes and congested reinforcement, so treating no signal as no defect leaves the anchorage zones, where corrosion is most likely, unchecked; visual inspection without drilling cannot see voids and chalky grout inside the duct. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b055-v13-29","title":"以振動估計鋼腱殘餘張力：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Estimating residual tendon force by vibration: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-28"],"objective":"說明「鋼腱自振頻率」如何影響橋梁預力鋼腱更換的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Tendon natural frequency” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge prestressing-tendon replacement”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"外置鋼腱在兩個轉向塊之間像一根拉緊的弦，張力越大，橫向自振頻率越高。以小錘輕敲或環境振動激發，用加速度計量到基頻即可反推張力，不必切開套管就能比較各條鋼腱的力量；FDOT 在 Mid-Bay 的狀況評估中也使用了南佛羅里達大學發展的振動測試技術。灌漿後的鋼腱具有彎曲勁度，轉向處也不是理想鉸接，因此絕對值需要校正，最可靠的用法是比較同一跨各條鋼腱或同一條鋼腱的歷年變化。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「鋼腱自振頻率」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Between two deviators an external tendon behaves like a taut string: the higher the tension, the higher its transverse natural frequency. Excited by a light hammer tap or ambient vibration, the fundamental frequency measured with an accelerometer can be inverted to tension, letting engineers compare tendon forces without opening the duct; FDOT's Mid-Bay condition assessment also used a vibration testing technique developed at the University of South Florida. A grouted tendon has bending stiffness and deviators are not ideal pins, so absolute values need calibration; the most reliable use is comparing tendons within one span, or one tendon year by year. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Tendon natural frequency” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：弦振動 f₁ = (1/2L)·√(T/m)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: String vibration gives f₁ = (1/2L)·√(T/m).","failure":"常見誤解：「鋼腱振動頻率只要有變化，就一定是斷了鋼絲。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Any change in a tendon's vibration frequency must mean broken wires.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「鋼腱自振頻率」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Tendon natural frequency”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-29-k1","title":"以振動估計鋼腱殘餘張力","titleEn":"Estimating residual tendon force by vibration","text":"外置鋼腱在兩個轉向塊之間像一根拉緊的弦，張力越大，橫向自振頻率越高。以小錘輕敲或環境振動激發，用加速度計量到基頻即可反推張力，不必切開套管就能比較各條鋼腱的力量；FDOT 在 Mid-Bay 的狀況評估中也使用了南佛羅里達大學發展的振動測試技術。","textEn":"Between two deviators an external tendon behaves like a taut string: the higher the tension, the higher its transverse natural frequency. Excited by a light hammer tap or ambient vibration, the fundamental frequency measured with an accelerometer can be inverted to tension, letting engineers compare tendon forces without opening the duct; FDOT's Mid-Bay condition assessment also used a vibration testing technique developed at the University of South Florida.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：鋼腱振動頻率只要有變化，就一定是斷了鋼絲。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Any change in a tendon's vibration frequency must mean broken wires. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「以振動估計鋼腱殘餘張力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Estimating residual tendon force by vibration\" is correct?","options":["鋼腱振動頻率只要有變化，就一定是斷了鋼絲。","真空灌注可以讓已腐蝕的鋼腱恢復原來的強度。","外置鋼腱在兩個轉向塊之間像一根拉緊的弦，張力越大，橫向自振頻率越高。"],"optionsEn":["Any change in a tendon's vibration frequency must mean broken wires.","Vacuum injection restores a corroded tendon to its original strength.","Between two deviators an external tendon behaves like a taut string: the higher the tension, the higher its transverse natural frequency."],"answer":2,"explanation":"外置鋼腱在兩個轉向塊之間像一根拉緊的弦，張力越大，橫向自振頻率越高。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Between two deviators an external tendon behaves like a taut string: the higher the tension, the higher its transverse natural frequency. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b055-v13-30","title":"以振動估計鋼腱殘餘張力：定量估算","titleEn":"Estimating residual tendon force by vibration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「鋼腱自振頻率」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Tendon natural frequency” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：弦振動 f₁ = (1/2L)·√(T/m)。自由長度 L = 20 m，單位長質量 m ≈ 鋼絞線 19×1.10 + 灌漿 9.9 + 套管 1.5 ≈ 32.3 kg/m；T = 2,970 kN 時 f₁ = (1/40)×√(2,970,000/32.3) ≈ 7.6 Hz。因 f ∝ √T，張力降 30% 時頻率降為約 6.3 Hz。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: String vibration gives f₁ = (1/2L)·√(T/m). With a free length L = 20 m and a mass per metre m ≈ strand 19×1.10 + grout 9.9 + duct 1.5 ≈ 32.3 kg/m, T = 2,970 kN gives f₁ = (1/40)×√(2,970,000/32.3) ≈ 7.6 Hz. Because f ∝ √T, a 30% loss of tension lowers it to about 6.3 Hz. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以加速度計量取至少前三個模態，檢查 f_n 是否隨 n 線性增加以確認弦模型適用，偏離時改用含彎曲勁度的模型；以剛完成張拉、力量已知的新鋼腱做現場標定，再換算同跨其他鋼腱的張力，差異超過約 10% 者列為優先開窗檢查對象。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record at least the first three modes and check that f_n grows linearly with n, confirming the string model, and switch to a model with bending stiffness if it does not; calibrate on site with a freshly stressed tendon of known force, convert the frequencies of the other tendons in the span, and prioritise any that differ by more than about 10% for opening and inspection.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"弦振動 f₁ = (1/2L)·√(T/m)。自由長度 L = 20 m，單位長質量 m ≈ 鋼絞線 19×1.10 + 灌漿 9.9 + 套管 1.5 ≈ 32.3 kg/m；T = 2,970 kN 時 f₁ = (1/40)×√(2,970,000/32.3) ≈ 7.6 Hz。因 f ∝ √T，張力降 30% 時頻率降為約 6.3 Hz。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"String vibration gives f₁ = (1/2L)·√(T/m). With a free length L = 20 m and a mass per metre m ≈ strand 19×1.10 + grout 9.9 + duct 1.5 ≈ 32.3 kg/m, T = 2,970 kN gives f₁ = (1/40)×√(2,970,000/32.3) ≈ 7.6 Hz. Because f ∝ √T, a 30% loss of tension lowers it to about 6.3 Hz. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「以振動估計鋼腱殘餘張力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Estimating residual tendon force by vibration\", which statement holds?","options":["弦振動 f₁ = (1/2L)·√(T/m)。","外置鋼腱斷一條只影響斷點附近，其餘跨段照常有預力。","只要灌漿的氯離子含量很低，鋼腱就不會腐蝕。"],"optionsEn":["String vibration gives f₁ = (1/2L)·√(T/m).","When one external tendon breaks, only the region near the break loses prestress.","If grout chloride content is very low, the tendon cannot corrode."],"answer":0,"explanation":"弦振動 f₁ = (1/2L)·√(T/m)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"String vibration gives f₁ = (1/2L)·√(T/m). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b055-v13-31","title":"以振動估計鋼腱殘餘張力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Estimating residual tendon force by vibration: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「鋼腱自振頻率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Tendon natural frequency” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以加速度計量取至少前三個模態，檢查 f_n 是否隨 n 線性增加以確認弦模型適用，偏離時改用含彎曲勁度的模型；以剛完成張拉、力量已知的新鋼腱做現場標定，再換算同跨其他鋼腱的張力，差異超過約 10% 者列為優先開窗檢查對象。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record at least the first three modes and check that f_n grows linearly with n, confirming the string model, and switch to a model with bending stiffness if it does not; calibrate on site with a freshly stressed tendon of known force, convert the frequencies of the other tendons in the span, and prioritise any that differ by more than about 10% for opening and inspection. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：為每一條鋼腱建立頻率指紋：施工或更換完成時量一次作為基準，之後在相近溫度下定期複量；量測點位、激振方式與感測器型號寫入檢測程序，以免換了檢測人員就換了方法。","observationEn":"Site practice: Give every tendon a frequency fingerprint: measure once at completion or after replacement as the baseline, then re-measure periodically at similar temperatures; write the measurement points, excitation method and sensor model into the inspection procedure so the method does not change with the inspector.","failure":"注意干擾：若把轉向處當成理想支點而忽略灌漿鋼腱的彎曲勁度，算出的張力會偏高，讓已失去部分鋼絲的鋼腱看起來正常；溫度變化也會改變張力與頻率，直接比較不同季節的資料可能誤判。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Treating deviators as ideal supports and ignoring the bending stiffness of a grouted tendon overestimates tension, making a tendon that has lost wires look normal; temperature also changes tension and frequency, so directly comparing data from different seasons can mislead. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以加速度計量取至少前三個模態，檢查 f_n 是否隨 n 線性增加以確認弦模型適用，偏離時改用含彎曲勁度的模型；以剛完成張拉、力量已知的新鋼腱做現場標定，再換算同跨其他鋼腱的張力，差異超過約 10% 者列為優先開窗檢查對象。","textEn":"Record at least the first three modes and check that f_n grows linearly with n, confirming the string model, and switch to a model with bending stiffness if it does not; calibrate on site with a freshly stressed tendon of known force, convert the frequencies of the other tendons in the span, and prioritise any that differ by more than about 10% for opening and inspection.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"為每一條鋼腱建立頻率指紋：施工或更換完成時量一次作為基準，之後在相近溫度下定期複量；量測點位、激振方式與感測器型號寫入檢測程序，以免換了檢測人員就換了方法。","textEn":"Give every tendon a frequency fingerprint: measure once at completion or after replacement as the baseline, then re-measure periodically at similar temperatures; write the measurement points, excitation method and sensor model into the inspection procedure so the method does not change with the inspector.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「以振動估計鋼腱殘餘張力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Estimating residual tendon force by vibration\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","以加速度計量取至少前三個模態，檢查 f_n 是否隨 n 線性增加以確認弦模型適用，偏離時改用含彎曲勁度的模型。","鋼腱已經斷了一部分，剩下的鋼絞線可以直接在錨頭燒斷。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Record at least the first three modes and check that f_n grows linearly with n, confirming the string model, and switch to a model with bending stiffness if it does not.","Once part of a tendon has broken, the remaining strands can simply be torched off at the anchorage."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以加速度計量取至少前三個模態，檢查 f_n 是否隨 n 線性增加以確認弦模型適用，偏離時改用含彎曲勁度的模型；以剛完成張拉、力量已知的新鋼腱做現場標定，再換算同跨其他鋼腱的張力，差異超過約 10% 者列為優先開窗檢查對象。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record at least the first three modes and check that f_n grows linearly with n, confirming the string model, and switch to a model with bending stiffness if it does not; calibrate on site with a freshly stressed tendon of known force, convert the frequencies of the other tendons in the span, and prioritise any that differ by more than about 10% for opening and inspection. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b055-v13-32","title":"以振動估計鋼腱殘餘張力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Estimating residual tendon force by vibration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「鋼腱自振頻率」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Tendon natural frequency” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若把轉向處當成理想支點而忽略灌漿鋼腱的彎曲勁度，算出的張力會偏高，讓已失去部分鋼絲的鋼腱看起來正常；溫度變化也會改變張力與頻率，直接比較不同季節的資料可能誤判。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Treating deviators as ideal supports and ignoring the bending stiffness of a grouted tendon overestimates tension, making a tendon that has lost wires look normal; temperature also changes tension and frequency, so directly comparing data from different seasons can mislead. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：灌漿後的鋼腱具有彎曲勁度，轉向處也不是理想鉸接，因此絕對值需要校正，最可靠的用法是比較同一跨各條鋼腱或同一條鋼腱的歷年變化。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A grouted tendon has bending stiffness and deviators are not ideal pins, so absolute values need calibration; the most reliable use is comparing tendons within one span, or one tendon year by year.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「鋼腱振動頻率只要有變化，就一定是斷了鋼絲。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Any change in a tendon's vibration frequency must mean broken wires.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若把轉向處當成理想支點而忽略灌漿鋼腱的彎曲勁度，算出的張力會偏高，讓已失去部分鋼絲的鋼腱看起來正常；溫度變化也會改變張力與頻率，直接比較不同季節的資料可能誤判。","textEn":"Treating deviators as ideal supports and ignoring the bending stiffness of a grouted tendon overestimates tension, making a tendon that has lost wires look normal; temperature also changes tension and frequency, so directly comparing data from different seasons can mislead.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「以振動估計鋼腱殘餘張力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Estimating residual tendon force by vibration\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","真空灌注可以讓已腐蝕的鋼腱恢復原來的強度。","若把轉向處當成理想支點而忽略灌漿鋼腱的彎曲勁度，算出的張力會偏高，讓已失去部分鋼絲的鋼腱看起來正常；溫度變化也會改變張力與頻率，直接比較不同季節的資料可能誤判。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Vacuum injection restores a corroded tendon to its original strength.","Treating deviators as ideal supports and ignoring the bending stiffness of a grouted tendon overestimates tension, making a tendon that has lost wires look normal."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若把轉向處當成理想支點而忽略灌漿鋼腱的彎曲勁度，算出的張力會偏高，讓已失去部分鋼絲的鋼腱看起來正常；溫度變化也會改變張力與頻率，直接比較不同季節的資料可能誤判。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Treating deviators as ideal supports and ignoring the bending stiffness of a grouted tendon overestimates tension, making a tendon that has lost wires look normal; temperature also changes tension and frequency, so directly comparing data from different seasons can mislead. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b055-v13-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「灌漿空隙修補與錨頭防護」與「長期監測、紀錄與交接」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Grout-void repair and anchorage protection\" and \"Long-term monitoring, records and handover\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b055-v13-33","title":"灌漿空隙修補與錨頭防護：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Grout-void repair and anchorage protection: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-32"],"objective":"說明「真空灌注與錨頭保護帽」如何影響橋梁預力鋼腱更換的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Vacuum injection and anchor caps” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge prestressing-tendon replacement”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"不是每一條有空隙的鋼腱都需要更換：鋼絲完好但灌漿不滿時，可用真空輔助灌注先把空隙抽成負壓，再注入低泌水灌漿或樹脂填滿，阻斷水氣與氧氣。Mid-Bay 在 2000 年事件後即對錨頭空隙進行真空再灌漿，後續整治也包含鋼腱包覆與錨頭保護。錨頭是最容易進水的位置，修補後要以防蝕帽、密封材與防水塗層形成多道屏障，並保留可檢查的觀察孔。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「真空灌注與錨頭保護帽」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Not every tendon with a void needs replacement: where wires are sound but the grout is incomplete, vacuum-assisted injection first evacuates the void and then fills it with low-bleed grout or resin, cutting off water and oxygen. After the 2000 event, Mid-Bay's anchorage voids were vacuum-regrouted, and later rehabilitation also included tendon wrapping and anchorage protection. Anchorages are the likeliest entry points for water, so repairs should build several barriers with protective caps, sealants and waterproof coatings and keep an inspectable port. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Vacuum injection and anchor caps” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：真空體積法以波以耳定律量空隙：真空槽 V_t = 20 L 抽至 0.1 bar（絕對壓力），接上空隙（初始 1.0 bar），平衡後 0.4 bar。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Vacuum volumetry measures a void with Boyle's law: a 20 L tank evacuated to 0.1 bar absolute is connected to a void initially at 1.0 bar, and the pressures equalise at 0.4 bar.","failure":"常見誤解：「真空灌注可以讓已腐蝕的鋼腱恢復原來的強度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Vacuum injection restores a corroded tendon to its original strength.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「真空灌注與錨頭保護帽」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Vacuum injection and anchor caps”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-33-k1","title":"灌漿空隙修補與錨頭防護","titleEn":"Grout-void repair and anchorage protection","text":"不是每一條有空隙的鋼腱都需要更換：鋼絲完好但灌漿不滿時，可用真空輔助灌注先把空隙抽成負壓，再注入低泌水灌漿或樹脂填滿，阻斷水氣與氧氣。Mid-Bay 在 2000 年事件後即對錨頭空隙進行真空再灌漿，後續整治也包含鋼腱包覆與錨頭保護。","textEn":"Not every tendon with a void needs replacement: where wires are sound but the grout is incomplete, vacuum-assisted injection first evacuates the void and then fills it with low-bleed grout or resin, cutting off water and oxygen. After the 2000 event, Mid-Bay's anchorage voids were vacuum-regrouted, and later rehabilitation also included tendon wrapping and anchorage protection.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：真空灌注可以讓已腐蝕的鋼腱恢復原來的強度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Vacuum injection restores a corroded tendon to its original strength. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「灌漿空隙修補與錨頭防護」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Grout-void repair and anchorage protection\" is correct?","options":["不是每一條有空隙的鋼腱都需要更換：鋼絲完好但灌漿不滿時，可用真空輔助灌注先把空隙抽成負壓，再注入低泌水灌漿或樹脂填滿，阻斷水氣與氧氣。","真空灌注可以讓已腐蝕的鋼腱恢復原來的強度。","鋼腱更換完成後，這座橋的預力問題就徹底解決了。"],"optionsEn":["Not every tendon with a void needs replacement: where wires are sound but the grout is incomplete, vacuum-assisted injection first evacuates the void and then fills it with low-bleed grout or resin, cutting off water and oxygen.","Vacuum injection restores a corroded tendon to its original strength.","Once tendons are replaced, the bridge's prestressing problems are solved for good."],"answer":0,"explanation":"不是每一條有空隙的鋼腱都需要更換：鋼絲完好但灌漿不滿時，可用真空輔助灌注先把空隙抽成負壓，再注入低泌水灌漿或樹脂填滿，阻斷水氣與氧氣。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Not every tendon with a void needs replacement: where wires are sound but the grout is incomplete, vacuum-assisted injection first evacuates the void and then fills it with low-bleed grout or resin, cutting off water and oxygen. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b055-v13-34","title":"灌漿空隙修補與錨頭防護：定量估算","titleEn":"Grout-void repair and anchorage protection: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「真空灌注與錨頭保護帽」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Vacuum injection and anchor caps” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：真空體積法以波以耳定律量空隙：真空槽 V_t = 20 L 抽至 0.1 bar（絕對壓力），接上空隙（初始 1.0 bar），平衡後 0.4 bar。0.1×20 + 1.0×V = 0.4×(20 + V)，得 V = 10 L；若 100 mm 套管頂部空隙截面約 2,000 mm²，空隙長度約 5 m。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Vacuum volumetry measures a void with Boyle's law: a 20 L tank evacuated to 0.1 bar absolute is connected to a void initially at 1.0 bar, and the pressures equalise at 0.4 bar. 0.1×20 + 1.0×V = 0.4×(20 + V) gives V = 10 L; if the void at the top of a 100 mm duct has a cross-section of about 2,000 mm², it is about 5 m long. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：灌注前以真空體積法量測空隙體積，灌注後與實際注入量比對，兩者差異過大代表有洩漏路徑或沒有填滿；完成後從原檢查孔再以內視鏡確認，並對錨頭保護帽做壓力或氣密試驗。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the void volume by vacuum volumetry before injection and compare it with the volume actually injected; a large difference signals a leak path or incomplete filling.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"真空體積法以波以耳定律量空隙：真空槽 V_t = 20 L 抽至 0.1 bar（絕對壓力），接上空隙（初始 1.0 bar），平衡後 0.4 bar。0.1×20 + 1.0×V = 0.4×(20 + V)，得 V = 10 L；若 100 mm 套管頂部空隙截面約 2,000 mm²，空隙長度約 5 m。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Vacuum volumetry measures a void with Boyle's law: a 20 L tank evacuated to 0.1 bar absolute is connected to a void initially at 1.0 bar, and the pressures equalise at 0.4 bar. 0.1×20 + 1.0×V = 0.4×(20 + V) gives V = 10 L; if the void at the top of a 100 mm duct has a cross-section of about 2,000 mm², it is about 5 m long. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「灌漿空隙修補與錨頭防護」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Grout-void repair and anchorage protection\", which statement holds?","options":["只要其餘鋼腱沒斷，更換期間的橋就和平常一樣安全。","真空體積法以波以耳定律量空隙：真空槽 V_t = 20 L 抽至 0.1 bar（絕對壓力），接上空隙（初始 1.0 bar），平衡後 0.4 bar。","外置鋼腱因為看得到，天生就可以更換，不需要特別的細部。"],"optionsEn":["As long as the other tendons are intact, the bridge is as safe as usual during a replacement.","Vacuum volumetry measures a void with Boyle's law: a 20 L tank evacuated to 0.1 bar absolute is connected to a void initially at 1.0 bar, and the pressures equalise at 0.4 bar.","Because external tendons are visible, they are inherently replaceable without special detailing."],"answer":1,"explanation":"真空體積法以波以耳定律量空隙：真空槽 V_t = 20 L 抽至 0.1 bar（絕對壓力），接上空隙（初始 1.0 bar），平衡後 0.4 bar。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Vacuum volumetry measures a void with Boyle's law: a 20 L tank evacuated to 0.1 bar absolute is connected to a void initially at 1.0 bar, and the pressures equalise at 0.4 bar. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b055-v13-35","title":"灌漿空隙修補與錨頭防護：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Grout-void repair and anchorage protection: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「真空灌注與錨頭保護帽」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Vacuum injection and anchor caps” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"灌注前以真空體積法量測空隙體積，灌注後與實際注入量比對，兩者差異過大代表有洩漏路徑或沒有填滿；完成後從原檢查孔再以內視鏡確認，並對錨頭保護帽做壓力或氣密試驗。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the void volume by vacuum volumetry before injection and compare it with the volume actually injected; a large difference signals a leak path or incomplete filling. Afterwards re-check through the original holes with a borescope and pressure- or air-test the anchor caps. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：修補與更換的分界要事先定義，例如 MFL 或開窗顯示截面損失超過設定比例、或已有斷絲的鋼腱一律更換，只有鋼絲完好的空隙才做灌注；判定準則由業主的結構工程師核定並寫入維護手冊。","observationEn":"Site practice: Define the line between repair and replacement in advance, for example replacing any tendon whose MFL or opening shows section loss above a set fraction or any broken wires, and injecting only voids with sound wires; the owner's structural engineer approves the criteria and writes them into the maintenance manual.","failure":"注意干擾：若在已有大量斷絲的鋼腱上只做真空灌注，等於把損傷封起來看不見，鋼腱仍可能在數年後斷裂；灌注材料與舊灌漿不相容，或殘留水分沒有排出，也可能在界面持續腐蝕。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Vacuum-injecting a tendon that already has many broken wires only seals the damage out of sight, and the tendon may still rupture years later; a filler incompatible with the old grout, or moisture left trapped, can keep corroding at the interface. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"灌注前以真空體積法量測空隙體積，灌注後與實際注入量比對，兩者差異過大代表有洩漏路徑或沒有填滿；完成後從原檢查孔再以內視鏡確認，並對錨頭保護帽做壓力或氣密試驗。","textEn":"Measure the void volume by vacuum volumetry before injection and compare it with the volume actually injected; a large difference signals a leak path or incomplete filling. Afterwards re-check through the original holes with a borescope and pressure- or air-test the anchor caps.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"修補與更換的分界要事先定義，例如 MFL 或開窗顯示截面損失超過設定比例、或已有斷絲的鋼腱一律更換，只有鋼絲完好的空隙才做灌注；判定準則由業主的結構工程師核定並寫入維護手冊。","textEn":"Define the line between repair and replacement in advance, for example replacing any tendon whose MFL or opening shows section loss above a set fraction or any broken wires, and injecting only voids with sound wires; the owner's structural engineer approves the criteria and writes them into the maintenance manual.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「灌漿空隙修補與錨頭防護」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Grout-void repair and anchorage protection\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","千斤頂油壓達到目標值，就證明整條鋼腱的力量都正確。","灌注前以真空體積法量測空隙體積，灌注後與實際注入量比對，兩者差異過大代表有洩漏路徑或沒有填滿；完成後從原檢查孔再以內視鏡確認，並對錨頭保護帽做壓力或氣密試驗。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Reaching the target jack pressure proves the force is correct along the whole tendon.","Measure the void volume by vacuum volumetry before injection and compare it with the volume actually injected."],"answer":2,"explanation":"灌注前以真空體積法量測空隙體積，灌注後與實際注入量比對，兩者差異過大代表有洩漏路徑或沒有填滿；完成後從原檢查孔再以內視鏡確認，並對錨頭保護帽做壓力或氣密試驗。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the void volume by vacuum volumetry before injection and compare it with the volume actually injected; a large difference signals a leak path or incomplete filling. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b055-v13-36","title":"灌漿空隙修補與錨頭防護：失效診斷","titleEn":"Grout-void repair and anchorage protection: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「真空灌注與錨頭保護帽」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Vacuum injection and anchor caps” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若在已有大量斷絲的鋼腱上只做真空灌注，等於把損傷封起來看不見，鋼腱仍可能在數年後斷裂；灌注材料與舊灌漿不相容，或殘留水分沒有排出，也可能在界面持續腐蝕。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Vacuum-injecting a tendon that already has many broken wires only seals the damage out of sight, and the tendon may still rupture years later; a filler incompatible with the old grout, or moisture left trapped, can keep corroding at the interface. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：錨頭是最容易進水的位置，修補後要以防蝕帽、密封材與防水塗層形成多道屏障，並保留可檢查的觀察孔。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Anchorages are the likeliest entry points for water, so repairs should build several barriers with protective caps, sealants and waterproof coatings and keep an inspectable port.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「真空灌注可以讓已腐蝕的鋼腱恢復原來的強度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Vacuum injection restores a corroded tendon to its original strength.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若在已有大量斷絲的鋼腱上只做真空灌注，等於把損傷封起來看不見，鋼腱仍可能在數年後斷裂；灌注材料與舊灌漿不相容，或殘留水分沒有排出，也可能在界面持續腐蝕。","textEn":"Vacuum-injecting a tendon that already has many broken wires only seals the damage out of sight, and the tendon may still rupture years later; a filler incompatible with the old grout, or moisture left trapped, can keep corroding at the interface.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「灌漿空隙修補與錨頭防護」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Grout-void repair and anchorage protection\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["若在已有大量斷絲的鋼腱上只做真空灌注，等於把損傷封起來看不見，鋼腱仍可能在數年後斷裂；灌注材料與舊灌漿不相容，或殘留水分沒有排出，也可能在界面持續腐蝕。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","鋼腱更換完成後，這座橋的預力問題就徹底解決了。"],"optionsEn":["Vacuum-injecting a tendon that already has many broken wires only seals the damage out of sight, and the tendon may still rupture years later.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Once tendons are replaced, the bridge's prestressing problems are solved for good."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若在已有大量斷絲的鋼腱上只做真空灌注，等於把損傷封起來看不見，鋼腱仍可能在數年後斷裂；灌注材料與舊灌漿不相容，或殘留水分沒有排出，也可能在界面持續腐蝕。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Vacuum-injecting a tendon that already has many broken wires only seals the damage out of sight, and the tendon may still rupture years later; a filler incompatible with the old grout, or moisture left trapped, can keep corroding at the interface. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b055-v13-37","title":"長期監測、紀錄與交接：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Long-term monitoring, records and handover: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-36"],"objective":"說明「聲射監測與鋼腱履歷」如何影響橋梁預力鋼腱更換的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Acoustic emission and tendon records” governs force, deformation or durability in “Bridge prestressing-tendon replacement”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"鋼絲斷裂會釋放瞬間應力波，可被聲射（AE）感測器捕捉，因此在高風險跨段佈設感測器，就能即時記錄斷絲事件的時間與位置。FHWA 報告指出 Varina-Enon 橋在 2020 年 10 月裝設聲射監測，並稱其為偵測即時斷絲最經濟的技術；Wando River 橋則在更換鋼腱後加設兩條外置鋼腱以提高冗餘。交接時要留下每條鋼腱的履歷：材料批號、張拉與伸長量紀錄、灌漿或填充材、頻率基準、檢測孔位置與修補紀錄。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「聲射監測與鋼腱履歷」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A wire break releases a transient stress wave that acoustic emission (AE) sensors can capture, so instrumenting high-risk spans records the time and location of wire-break events in real time. FHWA reports that Varina-Enon Bridge received AE monitoring in October 2020 and calls it the most economical technology for detecting real-time wire breaks; at Wando River two extra external tendons were added after the replacement to raise redundancy. Handover must leave a history for every tendon: material heat numbers, stressing and elongation records, grout or filler, frequency baseline, inspection-hole locations and repair records. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Acoustic emission and tendon records” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：19 股七線鋼絞線共 19×7 = 133 根鋼絲，每斷一根約損失 1/133 ≈ 0.75% 的鋼材面積。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A tendon of 19 seven-wire strands has 19×7 = 133 wires, so each break removes about 1/133 ≈ 0.75% of the steel area.","failure":"常見誤解：「鋼腱更換完成後，這座橋的預力問題就徹底解決了。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once tendons are replaced, the bridge's prestressing problems are solved for good.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「聲射監測與鋼腱履歷」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Acoustic emission and tendon records”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-37-k1","title":"長期監測、紀錄與交接","titleEn":"Long-term monitoring, records and handover","text":"鋼絲斷裂會釋放瞬間應力波，可被聲射（AE）感測器捕捉，因此在高風險跨段佈設感測器，就能即時記錄斷絲事件的時間與位置。FHWA 報告指出 Varina-Enon 橋在 2020 年 10 月裝設聲射監測，並稱其為偵測即時斷絲最經濟的技術；Wando River 橋則在更換鋼腱後加設兩條外置鋼腱以提高冗餘。","textEn":"A wire break releases a transient stress wave that acoustic emission (AE) sensors can capture, so instrumenting high-risk spans records the time and location of wire-break events in real time. FHWA reports that Varina-Enon Bridge received AE monitoring in October 2020 and calls it the most economical technology for detecting real-time wire breaks; at Wando River two extra external tendons were added after the replacement to raise redundancy.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：鋼腱更換完成後，這座橋的預力問題就徹底解決了。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once tendons are replaced, the bridge's prestressing problems are solved for good. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「長期監測、紀錄與交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Long-term monitoring, records and handover\" is correct?","options":["鋼腱更換完成後，這座橋的預力問題就徹底解決了。","鋼絲斷裂會釋放瞬間應力波，可被聲射（AE）感測器捕捉，因此在高風險跨段佈設感測器，就能即時記錄斷絲事件的時間與位置。","外置鋼腱斷一條只影響斷點附近，其餘跨段照常有預力。"],"optionsEn":["Once tendons are replaced, the bridge's prestressing problems are solved for good.","A wire break releases a transient stress wave that acoustic emission (AE) sensors can capture, so instrumenting high-risk spans records the time and location of wire-break events in real time.","When one external tendon breaks, only the region near the break loses prestress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"鋼絲斷裂會釋放瞬間應力波，可被聲射（AE）感測器捕捉，因此在高風險跨段佈設感測器，就能即時記錄斷絲事件的時間與位置。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A wire break releases a transient stress wave that acoustic emission (AE) sensors can capture, so instrumenting high-risk spans records the time and location of wire-break events in real time. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b055-v13-38","title":"長期監測、紀錄與交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Long-term monitoring, records and handover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「聲射監測與鋼腱履歷」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Acoustic emission and tendon records” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：19 股七線鋼絞線共 19×7 = 133 根鋼絲，每斷一根約損失 1/133 ≈ 0.75% 的鋼材面積。若警戒值設在單一鋼腱 5% 面積損失，即 0.05×133 ≈ 6.65，約在第 7 次斷絲事件時發出警報。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A tendon of 19 seven-wire strands has 19×7 = 133 wires, so each break removes about 1/133 ≈ 0.75% of the steel area. An alert threshold of 5% area loss in one tendon corresponds to 0.05×133 ≈ 6.65, so the alarm is raised at about the seventh wire-break event. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：聲射系統安裝後以斷鉛試驗或校正敲擊確認每個感測器的靈敏度與定位精度，並定期檢查通訊與電源；每次警報都要經人工複核，比對事件波形、定位與交通紀錄，排除重車與伸縮縫撞擊造成的誤報。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: After installing the AE system, confirm each sensor's sensitivity and location accuracy with pencil-lead breaks or calibration taps, and check communications and power regularly; every alert needs a manual review comparing waveform, location and traffic records to rule out false alarms from heavy trucks or expansion-joint impacts.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"19 股七線鋼絞線共 19×7 = 133 根鋼絲，每斷一根約損失 1/133 ≈ 0.75% 的鋼材面積。若警戒值設在單一鋼腱 5% 面積損失，即 0.05×133 ≈ 6.65，約在第 7 次斷絲事件時發出警報。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"A tendon of 19 seven-wire strands has 19×7 = 133 wires, so each break removes about 1/133 ≈ 0.75% of the steel area. An alert threshold of 5% area loss in one tendon corresponds to 0.05×133 ≈ 6.65, so the alarm is raised at about the seventh wire-break event. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「長期監測、紀錄與交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Long-term monitoring, records and handover\", which statement holds?","options":["只要灌漿的氯離子含量很低，鋼腱就不會腐蝕。","鋼腱已經斷了一部分，剩下的鋼絞線可以直接在錨頭燒斷。","19 股七線鋼絞線共 19×7 = 133 根鋼絲，每斷一根約損失 1/133 ≈ 0.75% 的鋼材面積。"],"optionsEn":["If grout chloride content is very low, the tendon cannot corrode.","Once part of a tendon has broken, the remaining strands can simply be torched off at the anchorage.","A tendon of 19 seven-wire strands has 19×7 = 133 wires, so each break removes about 1/133 ≈ 0.75% of the steel area."],"answer":2,"explanation":"19 股七線鋼絞線共 19×7 = 133 根鋼絲，每斷一根約損失 1/133 ≈ 0.75% 的鋼材面積。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A tendon of 19 seven-wire strands has 19×7 = 133 wires, so each break removes about 1/133 ≈ 0.75% of the steel area. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b055-v13-39","title":"長期監測、紀錄與交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Long-term monitoring, records and handover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「聲射監測與鋼腱履歷」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Acoustic emission and tendon records” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"聲射系統安裝後以斷鉛試驗或校正敲擊確認每個感測器的靈敏度與定位精度，並定期檢查通訊與電源；每次警報都要經人工複核，比對事件波形、定位與交通紀錄，排除重車與伸縮縫撞擊造成的誤報。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"After installing the AE system, confirm each sensor's sensitivity and location accuracy with pencil-lead breaks or calibration taps, and check communications and power regularly; every alert needs a manual review comparing waveform, location and traffic records to rule out false alarms from heavy trucks or expansion-joint impacts. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：維護手冊應包含每跨的單一鋼腱移除交通限制表、檢測週期（例如高風險跨段縮短為半年一次）、警報處置流程與聯絡窗口；任何加載變更或橋面改建前，須由結構工程師重新檢核預力冗餘。","observationEn":"Site practice: The maintenance manual should include each span's single-tendon-removal traffic table, inspection intervals (for example six-monthly for high-risk spans), the alarm response procedure and contacts; before any load change or deck rebuild, a structural engineer must recheck prestress redundancy.","failure":"注意干擾：若交接文件只有竣工圖而沒有鋼腱層級的紀錄，多年後發生斷絲時，工程師無法判斷是同一灌漿批次、同一施工季節或同一細部的系統性問題，只能全面重新普查，成本與交通衝擊都被放大。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If handover leaves only as-built drawings without tendon-level records, engineers facing a wire break years later cannot tell whether it reflects a systemic problem of one grout batch, one construction season or one detail, and must resurvey everything at far greater cost and traffic impact. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"聲射系統安裝後以斷鉛試驗或校正敲擊確認每個感測器的靈敏度與定位精度，並定期檢查通訊與電源；每次警報都要經人工複核，比對事件波形、定位與交通紀錄，排除重車與伸縮縫撞擊造成的誤報。","textEn":"After installing the AE system, confirm each sensor's sensitivity and location accuracy with pencil-lead breaks or calibration taps, and check communications and power regularly; every alert needs a manual review comparing waveform, location and traffic records to rule out false alarms from heavy trucks or expansion-joint impacts.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"維護手冊應包含每跨的單一鋼腱移除交通限制表、檢測週期（例如高風險跨段縮短為半年一次）、警報處置流程與聯絡窗口；任何加載變更或橋面改建前，須由結構工程師重新檢核預力冗餘。","textEn":"The maintenance manual should include each span's single-tendon-removal traffic table, inspection intervals (for example six-monthly for high-risk spans), the alarm response procedure and contacts; before any load change or deck rebuild, a structural engineer must recheck prestress redundancy.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「長期監測、紀錄與交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Long-term monitoring, records and handover\"?","options":["聲射系統安裝後以斷鉛試驗或校正敲擊確認每個感測器的靈敏度與定位精度，並定期檢查通訊與電源。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要套管外觀沒有裂縫，裡面的鋼腱就一定完好。"],"optionsEn":["After installing the AE system, confirm each sensor's sensitivity and location accuracy with pencil-lead breaks or calibration taps, and check communications and power regularly.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","If the duct shows no cracks outside, the tendon inside must be sound."],"answer":0,"explanation":"聲射系統安裝後以斷鉛試驗或校正敲擊確認每個感測器的靈敏度與定位精度，並定期檢查通訊與電源；每次警報都要經人工複核，比對事件波形、定位與交通紀錄，排除重車與伸縮縫撞擊造成的誤報。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"After installing the AE system, confirm each sensor's sensitivity and location accuracy with pencil-lead breaks or calibration taps, and check communications and power regularly; every alert needs a manual review comparing waveform, location and traffic records to rule out false alarms from heavy trucks or expansion-joint impacts. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b055-v13-40","title":"長期監測、紀錄與交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Long-term monitoring, records and handover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"prerequisiteIds":["b055-v13-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「聲射監測與鋼腱履歷」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Acoustic emission and tendon records” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若交接文件只有竣工圖而沒有鋼腱層級的紀錄，多年後發生斷絲時，工程師無法判斷是同一灌漿批次、同一施工季節或同一細部的系統性問題，只能全面重新普查，成本與交通衝擊都被放大。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If handover leaves only as-built drawings without tendon-level records, engineers facing a wire break years later cannot tell whether it reflects a systemic problem of one grout batch, one construction season or one detail, and must resurvey everything at far greater cost and traffic impact. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：交接時要留下每條鋼腱的履歷：材料批號、張拉與伸長量紀錄、灌漿或填充材、頻率基準、檢測孔位置與修補紀錄。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Handover must leave a history for every tendon: material heat numbers, stressing and elongation records, grout or filler, frequency baseline, inspection-hole locations and repair records.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「鋼腱更換完成後，這座橋的預力問題就徹底解決了。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once tendons are replaced, the bridge's prestressing problems are solved for good.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b055-v13-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若交接文件只有竣工圖而沒有鋼腱層級的紀錄，多年後發生斷絲時，工程師無法判斷是同一灌漿批次、同一施工季節或同一細部的系統性問題，只能全面重新普查，成本與交通衝擊都被放大。","textEn":"If handover leaves only as-built drawings without tendon-level records, engineers facing a wire break years later cannot tell whether it reflects a systemic problem of one grout batch, one construction season or one detail, and must resurvey everything at far greater cost and traffic impact.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]},{"id":"b055-v13-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「長期監測、紀錄與交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Long-term monitoring, records and handover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","若交接文件只有竣工圖而沒有鋼腱層級的紀錄，多年後發生斷絲時，工程師無法判斷是同一灌漿批次、同一施工季節或同一細部的系統性問題，只能全面重新普查，成本與交通衝擊都被放大。","外置鋼腱斷一條只影響斷點附近，其餘跨段照常有預力。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","If handover leaves only as-built drawings without tendon-level records, engineers facing a wire break years later cannot tell whether it reflects a systemic problem of one grout batch, one construction season or one detail, and must resurvey everything at far greater cost and traffic impact.","When one external tendon breaks, only the region near the break loses prestress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若交接文件只有竣工圖而沒有鋼腱層級的紀錄，多年後發生斷絲時，工程師無法判斷是同一灌漿批次、同一施工季節或同一細部的系統性問題，只能全面重新普查，成本與交通衝擊都被放大。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If handover leaves only as-built drawings without tendon-level records, engineers facing a wire break years later cannot tell whether it reflects a systemic problem of one grout batch, one construction season or one detail, and must resurvey everything at far greater cost and traffic impact. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-24-148","v13s-fhwa-hif-19-067","v13s-fdot-detensioning-external-tendon","v13s-fhwa-hrt-13-028","v13s-corven-mid-bay-evaluation"],"curriculumVersion":13,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
